      "question": "What climate-related factors are assessed to evaluate the environmental risks under the EU Taxonomy framework at Vienna Airport?",
      "answer": "Changes in wind structures/patterns, Cold waves, Floods surface water flooding, groundwater, Forest fire, Heat waves / heat stress, Heavy precipitation hail, Heavy precipitation rain, Heavy precipitation snow/ice, Storms, Tornadoes",
