      "question": "What are the environmental objectives companies must address under the EU Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "Substantial contribution to pollution prevention and control, Substantial contribution to the protection and restoration of biodiversity and ecosystems, Substantial contribution to the sustainable use and protection of water and marine resources, Substantial contribution to the transition to a circular economy, climate change adaptation, climate change mitigation",
      "type": "Factoid",
