      "question": "Which legislative references are cited in relation to compliance with the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Article 10 (3), Article 12 (2), Article 13 (2), Article 14 (2), Article 15 (2), Article 8, Article II (3), Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178, Regulation (EU) 2020/852, Taxonomy Regulation",
      "type": "Factoid",
