      "question": "What are the six environmental objectives established by the EU Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "adaptation to climate change, climate change mitigation, pollution prevention, protection of ecosystems and biodiversity, sustainable use of water resources, transition to a circular economy",
      "type": "Factoid",
