      "question": "Which environmental objectives and their corresponding codes are defined under the EU Taxonomy in the context?",
      "answer": "Biodiversity and ecosystems: BIO, Circular Economy: CE, Climate Change Adaptation: CCA, Climate Change Mitigation: CCM, Pollution Prevention and Control: PPC, Water and Marine Resources: WTR",
      "type": "Factoid",
