      "question": "What are the climate and environmental priorities outlined in the EU Taxonomy framework for Vossloh's activities?",
      "answer": "climate change adaptation, climate change mitigation, climate protection, pollution prevention and control, protection and restoration of biodiversity and ecosystems, sustainable use and protection of water and marine resources, transition to a circular economy",
      "type": "Factoid",
