      "question": "Which environmental objectives are classified under the EU Taxonomy framework for sustainable economic activities?",
      "answer": "Climate change adaptation (code CCA), Climate protection (code CCM), Pollution prevention and control (code PPC), Protection of biodiversity and ecosystems (Code BIO), Protection of water and marine resources (code WTR), Transition to a circular economy (code CE)",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006113:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
