      "question": "What are the six environmental goals that economic activities must align with under the EU Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "Adaptation to climate change, Climate protection, Prevention of pollution, Protection of ecosystems and biodiversity, Sustainable use of water resources, Transition to a circular economy",
