      "question": "Which delegated regulations establish the framework and criteria for sustainable economic activities under the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139, Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178, Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2486, Environmental Delegated Act, Regulation (EU) 2020/852",
      "type": "Factoid",
