      "question": "What legal provisions and EU directives are referenced in relation to taxonomy compliance and reporting?",
      "answer": "Article 16 of Regulation (EU) 2020/852, Article 8 of EU Taxonomy Regulation, Directive 2010/31/EU, Disclosures Delegated Act, Regulation (EU) 2017/1369",
