      "question": "What are the Delegated Regulations assessed by TeamViewer Group for EU Taxonomy compliance?",
      "answer": "Delegated Regulation 2021/2139, Delegated Regulation 2022/1214, Delegated Regulation 2023/2485, Delegated Regulation 2023/2486",
