      "question": "Which regulations and annex are cited as foundational to the EU Taxonomy compliance in the context?",
      "answer": "2023/1214, 2023/2026, 2023/2086, 2023/2485, 2023/3850, 2023/3851, Annex I of Commission Delegated Regulations (EU) 2021/2139, Regulation (EU) 2020/852",
      "type": "Factoid",
