      "question": "What financial reporting standards and metrics are used to calculate taxonomy-related figures for Scout24?",
      "answer": "2023 financial year, IFRS, Section 315e (1) German Commercial Code, financial reporting, key figures revenue, CapEx and OpEx, revenue, capital expenditure and operating expenditure, scope of consolidation",
