      "question": "What factors impacted Uniper's taxonomy-eligible turnover in the electricity and gas business during 2023?",
      "answer": "average market prices, discontinuation of the price cap, electricity and gas business, price escalation formulas, price parameters, rise in the working price, spot market",
      "type": "Factoid",
