      "question": "How many environmental objectives are defined by the EU Taxonomy Regulation, and what do they aim to achieve?",
      "answer": "climate change adaptation, climate change mitigation, pollution prevention and control, protection of ecosystems, sustainable use and protection of water and marine resources, transition to a circular economy",
