      "question": "What categories of expenses are included in the KION Group's operating expense calculation under EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "building renovation measures, day-to-day servicing of assets, maintenance and repair, non-capitalized costs, property, plant and equipment, research and development, short-term lease",
