      "question": "Which types of capital expenditure are aligned with the EU Taxonomy in the vehicle-related business?",
      "answer": "additions to capitalized development costs, additions to property, plant and equipment, taxonomy-aligned capital expenditure, €20.0 (16.9) billion, €20.1 billion, €3.1 billion",
      "type": "Factoid",
