      "question": "What are the environmental objectives outlined in the Environmental Delegated Act that align with the EU Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "pollution prevention and control, protection and restoration of biodiversity and ecosystems, sustainable use and protection of water and marine resources, transition to a circular economy",
      "type": "Factoid",
