      "question": "Which corporate compliance and ethical areas were evaluated for alignment with EU Taxonomy minimum safeguards?",
      "answer": "compliance and anti-corruption, fair competition, human rights, minimum safeguards, supplier audits, taxes",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "test:000807:qa_pairs_factoid:0015",
