      "question": "What are the six environmental objectives defined by the EU Taxonomy to classify sustainable economic activities?",
      "answer": "Biodiversity (BIO), Circular economy (CE), Climate change adaptation (CCA), Climate change mitigation (CCM), Pollution (PPC), Water (WTR)",
