      "question": "What environmental objectives under the EU Taxonomy framework are mentioned in the context?",
      "answer": "adaptation to climate change, environmental goal of climate protection, prevention of pollution, protection of ecosystems and biodiversity, sustainable use and protection of water resources, transition to a circular economy",
