      "question": "What structural adaptations are implemented in buildings to mitigate climate risks under EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "adaptation of the peak cooling load, climate risk assessment screening, heat stress, orientation of the building, shading, structural measures",
      "type": "Factoid",
