      "question": "Which categories of building products are identified as contributing to climate change mitigation under EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "Manufacture of energy efficiency equipment for buildings, U-value threshold, energy consumption, low-temperature cooling and heating systems, photovoltaic (PV), renewable energy",
      "type": "Factoid",
