      "question": "Which metrics are used to evaluate taxonomy alignment in the context of EU Taxonomy compliance?",
      "answer": "taxonomy-aligned activities, taxonomy-aligned proportion of sales to total sales, taxonomy-aligned proportions of capital expenditures, taxonomy-aligned proportions of sales, taxonomy-aligned share of CapEx, taxonomy-aligned share of OpEx",
      "type": "Factoid",
