      "question": "What reporting metrics and financial terms are relevant for EU Taxonomy disclosures in the context?",
      "answer": "2023 reporting year, 2025 reporting year, Fees and commissions income, Non-financial report, forward-looking information, services other than lending and AuM",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "validation:000758:qa_pairs_factoid:0010",
