      "question": "What financial statement components are used to report taxonomy-relevant capital expenditures?",
      "answer": "Additions, Development of intangible assets and property, plant and equipment 2023, IONOS Group SE Consolidated Financial Statements 2023",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "test:000762:qa_pairs_factoid:0003",
