      "question": "Which articles in the EU Taxonomy Regulation outline environmental objectives, safeguards, and reporting obligations?",
      "answer": "Art. 10-16 EU Taxonomy, Art. 17 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation, Art. 18 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation, Article 8 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation",
