      "question": "Which regulatory references are foundational to the calculation of OpEx KPIs under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Annex I Point 1.1.3.1, Annex II, Del. Reg. C&P, Taxonomy Regulation Article 8, subsection 1.1.3.2 of Annex I",
      "type": "Factoid",
