      "question": "What metrics are used to assess compliance with EU Taxonomy objectives in SBO's financial reporting?",
      "answer": "CapEx KPI, OpEx, taxonomy KPIs, taxonomy-aligned turnover",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "test:000798:qa_pairs_factoid:0002",
