      "question": "Which infrastructure upgrades at Vonovia are categorized as direct climate protection measures under the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "charging stations, direct climate protection measure, heating modernization, photovoltaic systems, wall boxes",
      "type": "Factoid",
