      "question": "What components are considered in the calculation of the OpEx KPI under Annex I of Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178?",
      "answer": "OpEx KPI, direct non-capitalised costs relating to research and development, maintenance and repairs, short-term leases, total operating expenses",
      "type": "Factoid",
