      "question": "Which economic activities at Vienna Airport are classified as taxonomy-relevant under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Acquisition and ownership of buildings, Air transport ground handling services, Creative, arts and entertainment activities, Electricity generation using solar photovoltaic technology, Low carbon airport infrastructure",
      "type": "Factoid",
