      "question": "Which legislative references outline the requirements for taxonomy alignment and environmental objectives?",
      "answer": "Art. 10 of Commission Delegated Regulation 2021/2178, Art. 18 (1), Art. 18 (2), Art. 18 of Regulation 2020/852, Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/3850",
      "type": "Factoid",
