      "question": "What environmental objectives are outlined in the context that align with EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "Biodiversity, Circular Economy, Climate Change Adaptation, Pollution Prevention, climate change mitigation",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006153:qa_pairs_factoid:0006",
