      "question": "Which industries are prioritized in the EU Taxonomy due to their significant environmental impact?",
      "answer": "agriculture, energy, industry, sectors with the highest emissions, transport",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006185:qa_pairs_factoid:0005",
