      "question": "What EU Taxonomy-related terms are referenced in the context of United Internet's turnover reporting?",
      "answer": "Taxonomy-aligned economic activities, Taxonomy-aligned turnover, Taxonomy-eligible economic activities, Taxonomy-eligible turnover",
