      "question": "What types of revenue-generating activities are included under taxonomy-eligible economic activity CCM 6.10?",
      "answer": "chartering of slots under slot charter agreements, demurrage and detention fees, net freight revenues, occasional chartering of vessels, pending voyages",
      "type": "Factoid",
