      "question": "What criteria are used to assess taxonomy alignment for economic activities in the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "DNSH criteria, minimum level of protection, specific criteria, technical assessment criteria",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006323:qa_pairs_factoid:0012",
