      "question": "What principles related to ethical conduct are highlighted in the EU Taxonomy Regulation's disclosure requirements?",
      "answer": "Code of Conduct, compliance, corruption, fair competition, human rights",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
