      "question": "Which taxonomy-eligible activities of BayWa contribute to climate change mitigation and adaptation efforts?",
      "answer": "biomass heating plants for generating heat, cogeneration of heat and power, development of smart farming solutions for agriculture, heat generation, manufacture of thermal insulation products and external wall systems",
