      "question": "Which economic sectors are linked to the sales-related KPI calculation under the Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "3.1 Manufacture of renewable energy technologies, 3.17 Manufacture of plastics in primary forms, 3.18 Manufacture of automotive and mobility components, 3.4 Manufacture of batteries, 3.6 Manufacture of other lowcarbon technologies",
      "type": "Factoid",
