      "question": "Which articles define taxonomy-eligible and taxonomy-aligned economic activities in the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Art. 1, nos. 5 and 6, Art. 17 of the Taxonomy Regulation, Art. 8 Delegated Act",
