      "question": "What are the key environmental focus areas defined in the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Biodiversity and ecosystems: BIO, Circular economy: CE, Pollution: PPC, Water: WTR",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
