      "question": "Which EU environmental objectives are addressed by Vossloh's activities?",
      "answer": "EU environmental goal, Protect and restore biodiversity and ecosystems, preventing and reducing pollution",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
