      "question": "Which circular economy activities under the EU Taxonomy framework are highlighted by the KION Group?",
      "answer": "5.1 Repair, refurbishment and remanufacturing, 5.2 Sale of spare parts, 5.4 Sale of second-hand goods, 5.5 Product-as-a-service",
