      "question": "What criteria must non-financial undertakings meet to align activities with multiple environmental objectives under the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "alignment with each of environmental objectives, eligibility and alignment per environmental objective, most relevant environmental objective, multiple environmental objectives",
      "type": "Factoid",
