      "question": "Which EU Commission communications provide guidance on the interpretation of Article 8 of the Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "2022/C 385/01, C/2023/305, FAQ on the interpretation of Article 8, draft Commission communication of 21 December 2023",
