      "question": "Which electricity generation activities identified by Uniper in 2023 align with EU Taxonomy criteria for sustainable energy production?",
      "answer": "CCM 4.28 Electricity generation from nuclear energy in existing plants, CCM 4.29 Electricity generation from gaseous fossil fuels, CCM 4.5 Electricity generation from hydropower",
      "type": "Factoid",
