      "question": "Which divisions of Wacker Chemie AG contribute to the WACKER Group's sustainability goals under EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "WACKER BIOSOLUTIONS, WACKER POLYMERS, WACKER POLYSILICON, WACKER SILICONES",
