      "question": "Which EU legislative acts define the DNSH criteria for pollution prevention and control?",
      "answer": "Amended Climate Delegated Act (EU) 2023/2485, Appendix C of Annex 1, Delegated Act (EU) 2021/2139, current European legislation on chemicals",
