      "question": "What international frameworks are referenced in the Taxonomy Regulation to ensure compliance with minimum safeguards?",
      "answer": "International Bill of Human Rights, International Labour Organization's core labor standards, OECD Guidelines for Multinational Enterprises, United Nations Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights",
      "type": "Factoid",
