      "question": "Which taxonomy-eligible activities were evaluated by the KION Group for compliance with DNSH criteria?",
      "answer": "3.10 Manufacture of hydrogen, 3.2 Manufacture of equipment for the production and use of hydrogen, 3.4 Manufacture of batteries, 3.6 Manufacture of other low-carbon technologies",
      "type": "Factoid",
