      "question": "Why is the collection and evaluation of evidence critical for verifying compliance with the EU Taxonomy Regulation and section 267a UGB in the Company's non-financial report, and how does this process ensure material accuracy in sustainability disclosures?",
      "answer": "The context implies that evidence is crucial for verifying compliance, as it forms the basis for determining whether the Company's non-financial report adheres to the regulatory requirements in all material aspects.",
