      "question": "Why does the EU Taxonomy require companies with non-financial reporting obligations to disclose their alignment with sustainability objectives, and how does this promote accountability and transparency in environmental and social impact reporting?",
      "answer": "The EU Taxonomy requires these companies to assess and disclose their activities' alignment with sustainability objectives, promoting accountability and transparency in their environmental and social impact.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
