      "question": "Why does TAG anticipate that only a limited portion of its business activities will achieve alignment with the EU Taxonomy's technical screening criteria, and how do the requirements for evidence and interpretation contribute to this expectation?",
      "answer": "TAG expects only some of its business activities to meet the technical screening criteria due to the high requirements for Taxonomy alignment, the challenges of interpretation, and the stringent quality of evidence required. These factors limit the ability of all activities to comply.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005979:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0001",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
