      "question": "Why does PORR prioritize Energy, Transport, Water Supply, Sewerage, Waste Management and Remediation, and Construction and Real Estate sectors for taxonomy-relevant activities, and how does this reflect its alignment with EU Taxonomy objectives?",
      "answer": "PORR focuses on Energy, Transport, Water Supply, Sewerage, Waste Management and Remediation, and Construction and Real Estate because these sectors encompass the economic activities relevant to its operations and taxonomy eligibility.",
