      "question": "Why does the economic activity '7.7 Acquisition and ownership of buildings' fail to qualify as an enabling activity under Article 16 of Regulation (EU) 2020/852, and how does this impact its taxonomy eligibility for climate change adaptation?",
      "answer": "The economic activity '7.7 Acquisition and ownership of buildings' does not qualify as an enabling activity because it does not meet the criteria for taxonomy-eligible or taxonomy-aligned revenues under the environmental objective 'climate change adaptation'. Additionally, no adaptation solutions for significant physical climate risks have been implemented.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006051:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0001",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
