      "question": "Why did changes in energy prices lead to a decrease in revenue for cogeneration of heat/cool and power from renewable non-fossil gaseous and liquid fuels, and how does this align with EU Taxonomy objectives for sustainable energy production?",
      "answer": "The decrease in revenue for cogeneration of heat/cool and power from renewable non-fossil gaseous and liquid fuels was attributed to changed energy prices, as stated in the context.",
