      "question": "Why does the SYZYGY GROUP's exemption from Annex XII requirements suggest a narrower compliance scope under Delegated Regulation (EU) 2022/1214, and how might this affect its taxonomy-related disclosures for nuclear energy and fossil fuels?",
      "answer": "The context suggests that while the SYZYGY GROUP must disclose specific information about nuclear energy and fossil fuel activities, it is not subject to the detailed requirements of Annex XII, indicating a limited scope of compliance.",
