      "question": "Why is Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139 considered a foundational element of the EU Taxonomy framework, and how does its adaptation by Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2485 reflect the evolving scope of sustainable economic activities?",
      "answer": "Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139 serves as a foundational regulation that was later adapted by Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2485 to include new economic activities, reflecting the evolving scope of the taxonomy framework.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006328:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0011",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
