      "question": "Why is the Non-Financial Reporting Directive (NFRD) critical for implementing the Taxonomy Regulation's disclosure requirements, and how does its transition to the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) enhance compliance?",
      "answer": "The NFRD establishes the scope of entities required to comply with the Taxonomy Regulation's disclosure obligations. From 2024, it will be replaced by the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD), which continues to mandate taxonomy-related disclosures.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005968:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0008",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
