      "question": "How do columns (5) to (17) in Section A.2 support non-financial undertakings in providing additional insights into substantial contribution and DNSH criteria, and why is this optional reporting valuable under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Columns (5) to (17) in Section A.2 are optional for non-financial undertakings to fill, allowing them to provide additional details about substantial contribution and DNSH criteria for activities not aligning with any environmental objective.",
