      "question": "Why does Zalando SE provide separate information for Zalando SE and the Zalando group in its non-financial declaration, and how does this practice support compliance with the EU Taxonomy's transparency and accountability requirements?",
      "answer": "Zalando SE provides separate information for Zalando SE and the Zalando group to ensure clarity and specificity in reporting, allowing stakeholders to understand the performance and impact of each entity individually wherever possible.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
