      "question": "Why are the economic activities of repair, refurbishment, remanufacturing, and the sale of second-hand goods considered taxonomy-eligible under environmental goal 4, and how do they contribute to the transition to a circular economy?",
      "answer": "Technotrans can report taxonomy-eligible revenue for the categories 5.1 (Repair, refurbishment, and remanufacturing) and 5.4 (Sale of second-hand goods) from Annex II of IR 2023/2486 under environmental goal 4.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006335:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
