      "question": "Why does the process of reporting taxonomy-aligned capital expenditures, as outlined in Annex 1 of the Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178, support the EU Taxonomy’s goal of harmonized and detailed financial disclosures?",
      "answer": "The context suggests that the process of reporting taxonomy-aligned capital expenditures involves breaking them down in accordance with the guidelines provided in Annex 1 of the Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178, ensuring detailed and standardized reporting.",
