      "question": "Why is the EU Taxonomy Regulation critical for promoting transparency and accountability in sustainability reporting, and how does it guide companies like AGRANA in aligning their economic activities with environmental objectives?",
      "answer": "The EU Taxonomy Regulation aims to define criteria for reporting revenues, investments, and operating expenses associated with sustainable economic activities. It provides a framework to ensure that such activities contribute to specific environmental objectives without harming others, promoting transparency and accountability in sustainability efforts.",
