      "question": "Why is the distinction between taxonomy-eligible and taxonomy-aligned turnover critical for the TRATON GROUP's compliance with EU Taxonomy criteria, and how does this impact its sustainability reporting and investor perception?",
      "answer": "The classification is important because it reflects the group's compliance with EU Taxonomy criteria, highlighting activities that contribute to environmental sustainability and meet technical screening criteria. This distinction impacts the group's financial reporting and sustainability metrics.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006422:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0012",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
