      "question": "Why is it necessary for executive directors to interpret the EU Taxonomy Regulation despite the inherent uncertainties in its legal terms, and how does this impact the defensibility of the consolidated non-financial statement?",
      "answer": "The executive directors must interpret the EU Taxonomy Regulation because its wording and terms are subject to considerable uncertainties, and clarifications have not been provided in all cases. This interpretation is necessary to prepare the consolidated non-financial statement in compliance with the regulation.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
