      "question": "Why is turnover from electricity generation using solar photovoltaic technology (activity 4.1) considered taxonomy-aligned, and how does this activity contribute to climate change mitigation under the EU Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "Turnover from electricity generation using solar photovoltaic technology is treated as a direct climate change mitigation measure under the EU Taxonomy Regulation, indicating its alignment with environmental objectives without additional criteria.",
