      "question": "Why does the Amadeus Fire Group's training revenue fail to meet the EU Taxonomy criteria for climate change mitigation, and what changes could make these activities eligible for substantial contribution under this objective?",
      "answer": "The training revenue does not meet the criteria for substantial contribution to climate change mitigation under the EU Taxonomy Regulation, as it lacks specific focus on solutions relevant to energy or climate.",
