      "question": "How does using consolidated revenue as the denominator in the calculation ensure transparency and alignment with EU Taxonomy reporting standards, and why is this approach significant for assessing sustainability performance?",
      "answer": "Using consolidated revenue as the denominator provides a comprehensive measure of the Group's total net revenues, ensuring that the share of Taxonomy-eligible activities is accurately represented relative to overall business performance.",
