        "paragraph": "- Focus story 1: Ship Green  $11$\n- $13$ Our profile\n- 19 Customer focus and digitalisation\n- 22 Corporate governance and compliance\n- 34 Consolidated disclosures for the taxonomy regulation\n- **SUSTAINABILITY** 44 **AT HAPAG-LLOYD**\n- 69 CLIMATE AND **ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION**\n- 85 **EMPLOYEES**\n- **HEALTH AND SAFETY** 106\n- 118 CORPORATE **CITIZENSHIP**\n- 125 **INFORMATION**\nBased on the analysis of economic activities under the EU taxonomy, we do not identify any activities that specifically address the environmental goal of climate change adaptation and are thus to be considered taxonomy-aligned for this environmental objective. In order to avoid double counting, the activities are also not considered taxonomy-eligible for this environmental objective. \\_NfR\nAs no key application has been identified for the economic activities described in the EU Commission's Delegated Act 2022/1214 and in Annex XII, the reporting pursuant to Annex XII of the EU Commission's Delegated Act 2021/2178 also does not apply. \\_NfR",
