      "question": "Why does the lack of taxonomy-aligned activities under the EU taxonomy limit Hapag-Lloyd's ability to report contributions to climate change adaptation, and what are the broader implications for its sustainability strategy?",
      "answer": "The lack of taxonomy-aligned activities implies that Hapag-Lloyd cannot report activities as contributing to the climate change adaptation goal under the EU taxonomy, which may limit its ability to showcase alignment with specific environmental objectives.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006207:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
