      "question": "Why does the absence of critical physical climate risks for Uniper’s taxonomy-aligned assets in 2023 justify the decision not to implement short-term adjustment measures, and how does this align with EU Taxonomy principles?",
      "answer": "It is unnecessary to implement a short-term adjustment plan because the assessment found no critical physical climate risks for Uniper’s taxonomy-aligned hydropower and district heating plants in the 2023 fiscal year.",
