      "question": "Why are building-related activities, such as construction and renovation, critical to achieving the EU Taxonomy's environmental objectives, and how do the 'Construction and real estate' criteria address these activities?",
      "answer": "The 'Construction and real estate' criteria in the EU Taxonomy cover the construction of new buildings, renovation of existing buildings, implementation of individual energy efficiency measures, and the acquisition and ownership of buildings. These aspects ensure that building-related activities contribute to environmental objectives such as energy efficiency and sustainability.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006410:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0012",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
