      "question": "Why is it essential for economic activities to meet technical screening criteria, DNSH principles, and social safeguards to be considered Taxonomy-aligned, and how does this ensure alignment with EU sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "To be Taxonomy-aligned, economic activities must meet technical screening criteria for substantial contributions to environmental objectives, do no significant harm (DNSH) to other objectives, and comply with minimum social safeguards.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "validation:000801:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
