      "question": "How did the company assess whether its 'Data processing, hosting and related activities' could impair compliance with other EU environmental objectives, and why is this analysis critical under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "The company analysed whether its 'Data processing, hosting and related activities' economic activity could significantly impair compliance with the other EU environmental objectives, as part of its review of the EU Taxonomy criteria.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
