      "question": "Why are general-purpose loans and securities classified as Taxonomy-non-eligible or Taxonomy-non-aligned when no information is available, and what challenges does this pose for compliance with the Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "If no information is available for general-purpose loans and securities, they are assessed as Taxonomy-non-eligible or Taxonomy-non-aligned.",
