      "question": "How do §§ 315c in conjunction with 289c to 289e HGB support the integration of the EU Taxonomy Regulation into the Combined Separate Non-financial Report, and why is this alignment important for regulatory compliance?",
      "answer": "Referencing these sections of HGB establishes the legal basis and framework for preparing the Combined Separate Non-financial Report, ensuring compliance with German accounting and reporting standards.",
