      "question": "Why is addressing Biodiversity and Ecosystems (E4) critical within the EU Taxonomy framework, and how does it create cascading benefits for Climate Change adaptation, Pollution reduction, and resource sustainability?",
      "answer": "Addressing Biodiversity and Ecosystems (E4) can positively impact other areas of the EU Taxonomy by enhancing ecosystem resilience, supporting climate adaptation, and reducing pollution through natural processes.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005992:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0012",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
