      "question": "Why are 'New construction' and 'Renovation of existing buildings' categorized under environmental objective (4) 'Circular Economy' in TAG's business model, and how do these activities align with EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "In TAG's business model, activities associated with environmental objective (4) 'Circular Economy' include '3.1 New construction' and '3.2 Renovation of existing buildings,' which are part of its taxonomy-eligible activities.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006302:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
