      "question": "Why were no taxonomy-aligned activities identified for Uniper in relation to environmental objectives 3 to 6, and how does this reflect the scope and limitations of its business model under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "The context reveals that no new taxonomy-aligned activities within the scope of Uniper's business activities were identified in relation to the new environmental objectives 3 to 6. This indicates that these objectives did not align with Uniper's current operations or taxonomy criteria in 2023.",
