      "question": "How do the six environmental objectives listed in Article 9 of the Taxonomy Regulation contribute to the EU's broader sustainability goals, and why is their inclusion significant for economic activity classification?",
      "answer": "The six environmental objectives listed in Article 9 of the Taxonomy Regulation are: climate change mitigation, climate change adaptation, sustainable use and protection of water and marine resources, transition to a circular economy, pollution prevention and control, and protection and restoration of biodiversity and ecosystems.",
