      "question": "Why does Delegated Regulation 2022/1214 on nuclear energy and natural gas have no impact on Scout24 Group’s taxonomy compliance, and what does this indicate about sector-specific applicability under the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "Delegated Regulation 2022/1214, which addresses nuclear energy and natural gas, does not impact Scout24 Group and is therefore not applicable to its taxonomy compliance.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006130:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
