      "question": "Why is it important for organizations to track CapEx and OpEx shares specifically for taxonomy-aligned activities, and how does this practice support transparency and accountability under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Tracking these shares allows organizations to measure their financial commitment to sustainability and ensure alignment with the EU Taxonomy's environmental objectives.",
