      "question": "How was taxonomy-aligned capital expenditure for hydrogen-related equipment disclosed, and why is the balance between intangible assets and property, plant, and equipment significant under EU Taxonomy principles?",
      "answer": "Taxonomy-aligned capital expenditure for hydrogen-related equipment was disclosed at €37 million, with half attributed to intangible assets and the other half to property, plant, and equipment. This reflects a balanced investment in both tangible and intangible resources.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005929:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
