      "question": "Why is the presence of specific infrastructure, such as onshore power supply or carbon exhaust-free vessel operation, critical for seaport terminals to meet the EU Taxonomy criteria for climate change mitigation?",
      "answer": "The context defines this relationship by stating that seaport terminals must have specific infrastructure, such as for vessel operation without carbon exhaust emissions or onshore power supply, to significantly contribute to climate change mitigation. Additionally, infrastructure must not support fossil fuel transport or storage.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
