      "question": "Why did the right-of-use assets for company buildings fail to meet the technical screening criteria for substantial contributions to climate change mitigation under Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139?",
      "answer": "The right-of-use assets for company buildings were evaluated against the technical screening criteria for substantial contributions to climate change mitigation under Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139. However, they did not satisfy these criteria.",
