      "question": "Why is the €6.7 billion total capital expenditure under the capex plan significant for achieving the EU Taxonomy's long-term sustainability objectives, and how does it align with the five-year planning framework?",
      "answer": "The total capital expenditure under the capex plan, including the reporting period and the next five years, amounts to €6.7 billion.",
