      "question": "Why does the classification of luminaires in energy efficiency classes A or B under Regulation (EU) 2017/1369 determine their taxonomy alignment, and what implications does this have for sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "Only luminaires classified in energy efficiency classes A or B, the highest categories under Regulation (EU) 2017/1369, are considered taxonomy aligned. This ensures compliance with the technical screening criteria for energy efficiency.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
