      "question": "Why does the LED lighting conversion project qualify as a measure under category (c) of point 1.1.3.2 of Annex I of the Disclosures Delegated Act, and how does this classification support EU Taxonomy compliance?",
      "answer": "The LED lighting conversion project qualifies as a measure under category (c) of point 1.1.3.2 of Annex I of the Disclosures Delegated Act because it involves actions aimed at improving energy efficiency, which contributes to climate change mitigation objectives.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "test:000800:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
