      "question": "Why is it essential for non-financial undertakings to identify and highlight the most relevant environmental objective in bold when reporting contributions to multiple objectives under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Non-financial undertakings must indicate the most relevant environmental objective in bold to avoid double counting when computing contributions to multiple objectives. This ensures clarity and accuracy in reporting, especially when activities contribute substantially to several environmental goals.",
