      "question": "How does Annex I of the Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178 define the components of taxonomy-aligned operating expenditures, and why is this breakdown significant for compliance with the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "The numerator of taxonomy-aligned operating expenditures is broken down pursuant to Annex 1 of the Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178.",
