      "question": "Why does Wienerberger include CO<sub>2</sub> emissions from biogenic input materials in its reporting for USA plants, and how does this practice align with EU Taxonomy criteria for holistic emissions accounting?",
      "answer": "For Wienerberger plants in the USA, CO<sub>2</sub> emissions from the production process are reported, including emissions from biogenic input materials, providing a complete picture of their emissions profile.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "validation:000767:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
