      "question": "Why is the 'Substantial Contribution' criterion essential in determining the environmental sustainability of economic activities under the EU Taxonomy, and how does it support the six environmental objectives?",
      "answer": "The 'Substantial Contribution' criterion ensures that economic activities meaningfully advance one or more of the six environmental objectives. This is a key requirement for classifying activities as environmentally sustainable under the taxonomy.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
