      "question": "How do the technical screening criteria within the EU Taxonomy guide TAG's project team in assessing the conformity of its business activities, and why are these criteria significant for regulatory compliance?",
      "answer": "The technical screening criteria provide sector-specific activity descriptions and NACE codes, which are essential for TAG's project team to determine whether its business activities conform to the Taxonomy requirements.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
