      "question": "Why does Art. 5 of Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2486 prioritize the evaluation of Taxonomy-eligibility for newly included economic activities, and how does this reflect the evolving scope of the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "The analysis of Taxonomy-eligibility for newly included economic activities in 2023 is emphasized to ensure that these additions align with the extended criteria of the EU Taxonomy. This process, mandated by Art. 5 of Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2486, ensures consistency and relevance in the Taxonomy framework.",
