      "question": "How do technical screening criteria established by the European Commission ensure consistency and rigor in evaluating Taxonomy-aligned economic activities, and why are they essential for regulatory compliance?",
      "answer": "Technical screening criteria, established by the European Commission, provide specific benchmarks that economic activities must meet to be considered Taxonomy-aligned, ensuring consistency and rigor in the evaluation process.",
