      "question": "Why is it essential for non-financial undertakings to identify and highlight the most relevant environmental objective in bold when calculating KPIs for financial undertakings under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Non-financial undertakings must indicate the most relevant environmental objective in bold to ensure accurate computation of KPIs for financial undertakings and avoid double counting of economic activities contributing to multiple environmental objectives.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005867:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0001",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
