      "question": "How does the management and operation of clients' computer systems contribute to the described economic activity, and why is this contribution not considered taxonomy-eligible under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "The management and operation of clients' computer systems or data processing facilities on-site is an integral part of the economic activity, reflecting its focus on providing IT expertise and support.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
