      "question": "Why is the calculation of taxonomy-eligible operating expenditure (OpEx) critical for demonstrating compliance with EU Taxonomy requirements, and how does the inclusion of new activities affect this process?",
      "answer": "Taxonomy-eligible OpEx was calculated by identifying relevant consolidated items, assigning them to company areas, and deducting expenditures from non-taxonomy-eligible activities. The remaining OpEx was split by company area and assigned to economic activities, factoring in new activities.",
