      "question": "Why does the EU Taxonomy include building refurbishment measures in both the numerator and denominator of operational expenditures calculations, and how does this dual inclusion support sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "Building refurbishment measures are included because they contribute to sustainability goals, such as reducing greenhouse gas emissions, and are part of both aligned economic activities and total operating expenses.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "validation:000804:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
