      "question": "Why does ANDRITZ prioritize strict adherence to the EU Taxonomy's definitions and wording when identifying taxonomy-eligible products, and how does this approach support compliance and sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "ANDRITZ relies on the European Commission's wording to ensure compliance with the EU's standards for sustainable economic activities. This approach provides a clear framework for determining which products meet the criteria for taxonomy eligibility, particularly regarding climate change mitigation.",
