      "question": "Why did Taxonomy-eligible expenses related to data processing decrease significantly between 2022 and 2023, and what implications does this have for the MLP Group's alignment with the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Taxonomy-eligible expenses related to data processing decreased significantly from €1,770 thsd (40% of eligible expenses) in 2022 to €1,008 thsd (16% of eligible expenses) in 2023.",
