      "question": "Why are interpretation uncertainties a critical challenge in achieving consistent application of the EU Taxonomy Regulation, and how might they influence long-term compliance and sustainability assessments?",
      "answer": "Interpretation uncertainties are significant because they create challenges in applying the regulation consistently, potentially leading to varying evaluations and KPI calculations over time.",
