      "question": "How do servicing and maintenance costs reflect the EU Taxonomy's principles of resource efficiency and sustainability, and why are they emphasized in the context of taxonomy-eligible operating expenditure?",
      "answer": "Servicing and maintenance costs are emphasized because they constitute the majority of taxonomy-eligible operating expenditure, particularly in the WACKER POLYMERS, WACKER SILICONES, and WACKER BIOSOLUTIONS business divisions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
