      "question": "Why does United Internet's approach to Taxonomy eligibility under Activity 8.1 prioritize the functional role of hosting and data storage over the distinction between its own and third-party data centers?",
      "answer": "United Internet does not differentiate between its own and third-party data centers because the focus is on the role of hosting and data storage in its Taxonomy-eligible activities. This approach ensures that all relevant activities under Activity 8.1 are included, regardless of the infrastructure used.",
