      "question": "Why is it critical for executive directors to ensure the defensibility of their interpretation of the EU Taxonomy Regulation, particularly in light of legal uncertainties and sustainable investment goals?",
      "answer": "The defensibility of the executive directors' interpretation is important because the EU Taxonomy Regulation and Delegated Acts contain indeterminate legal terms that may be interpreted differently. Ensuring defensibility helps mitigate risks associated with legal uncertainties and potential challenges to their interpretation.",
