      "question": "Why is divestment from companies with more than 5% revenue from natural gas by 2035 critical for achieving EU Taxonomy-aligned climate goals, and what are the broader implications for sustainable finance?",
      "answer": "The rationale is to ensure a complete withdrawal from significant financial ties to the natural gas sector by 2035, aligning with broader climate goals and reducing dependency on fossil fuel-related revenue streams.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006288:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
