      "question": "Why is it critical for economic activities to meet all technical screening criteria under the EU Taxonomy, and how does this ensure alignment with the framework's environmental objectives and safeguards?",
      "answer": "Meeting all technical screening criteria ensures that an economic activity substantially contributes to an environmental objective without causing significant harm to others. This comprehensive assessment is essential for the activity to qualify as environmentally sustainable under the EU Taxonomy.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
