      "question": "Why is taxonomy eligibility prioritized over alignment for EU environmental objectives 3 to 6 in the 2023 reporting year, and how does this reflect the phased implementation of the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "The emphasis on taxonomy eligibility for the 2023 reporting year likely reflects a phased approach to implementing the EU Taxonomy framework, focusing first on eligibility before alignment for objectives 3 to 6.",
