      "question": "How does the life-cycle assessment (LCA) of e-trucks contribute to their taxonomy-alignment under activity 3.6, and why does it currently fail to meet the EU Taxonomy's substantial contribution criteria?",
      "answer": "The life-cycle assessment (LCA) showed that e-trucks can achieve up to a 52% reduction in life-cycle GHG emissions compared to conventional internal combustion trucks. However, since the LCA was conducted in prior years under ISO 14040 and ISO 14044, it does not currently meet the substantial contribution criteria.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005981:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
