      "question": "Why are the activities classified under the EU Taxonomy Regulation considered pivotal for achieving environmental objectives, and how do they address both positive and negative impacts on sustainability?",
      "answer": "The activities in the EU Taxonomy Regulation are relevant because of their significant impact on the climate and environment, both positively and negatively, making them central to achieving sustainability goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006082:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0010",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
