      "question": "Why is the EU Commission's guidance, such as the FAQ on Article 8 and draft communications, essential for ensuring accurate and compliant taxonomy-related reporting under the Delegated Act on Disclosure?",
      "answer": "Considering the EU Commission's guidance, such as the FAQ and draft communications, is important because it provides clarity and ensures consistent interpretation of the Delegated Act on Disclosure, particularly for taxonomy-related reporting.",
