      "question": "How do lease assets, particularly those related to the vehicle leasing business, contribute to the Group's capital expenditure under the EU Taxonomy, and why are they significant for taxonomy compliance?",
      "answer": "Lease assets primarily include those related to the vehicle leasing business. Their significance lies in their contribution to the total capital expenditure under the EU Taxonomy, amounting to £33.0 billion, which is a substantial portion of the overall expenditure.",
