      "question": "Why are the articles referenced in the Taxonomy Regulation critical for identifying Taxonomy-eligible economic activities, and how do delegated acts ensure consistency with the EU's sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "The articles referenced for determining 'Taxonomy-eligible economic activities' include Art. 10 (3), Art. 11 (3), Art. 12 (2), Art. 13 (2), Art. 14 (2), and Art. 15 (2) of the Taxonomy Regulation. These articles are the basis for the delegated acts that list eligible activities.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
