      "question": "Why are 1&1's core business activities, such as telecommunications network rollout, excluded from EU Taxonomy eligibility, and what implications does this have for the company's sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "1&1's core business activities, such as the rollout and utilization of telecommunications networks, are not considered taxonomy-eligible because they do not fall under the specified EU taxonomy categories. This includes activities like network construction for mobile communications and related investments in network infrastructure.",
