      "question": "Why does the activity 'Electricity generation using solar photovoltaic technology' meet the criteria for climate change mitigation (CCM) but not for climate change adaptation (CCA) under the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "The activity is attributed to the environmental objective CCM because it meets the technical screening criteria for CCM, while the criteria for CCA are not met.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "validation:000786:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
