      "question": "Why is the Frequentis Code of Conduct critical for demonstrating compliance with the EU Taxonomy Regulation's minimum safeguards, and how does it address key areas like human rights and anti-corruption?",
      "answer": "The Frequentis Code of Conduct serves as an internal policy examined for adherence to the minimum safeguards, including human rights, compliance, anti-corruption, taxes, and fair competition, as outlined in Article 18 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation.",
