      "answer": "Temperature- and water-related hazards were prioritized due to their direct impact on operations, as evidenced by high summer temperatures and low river water levels affecting coal supply and hydro generation assets.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005962:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
