      "question": "Why does technotrans rely on internal product comparisons rather than benchmarking against market alternatives to demonstrate compliance with the EU Taxonomy's requirements for low-carbon technologies?",
      "answer": "The comparison is not feasible because technotrans supplies individual product solutions, making it impractical to benchmark against the best alternative on the market. Instead, comparisons are made between the company's standard and high-efficiency product versions.",
