      "question": "Why is calculating taxonomy-aligned metrics as a share of total net turnover, capital expenditure, and operating expenses critical for demonstrating compliance with EU taxonomy sustainability criteria?",
      "answer": "Calculating these metrics as a share of the total ensures compliance with EU taxonomy requirements and provides a clear understanding of the proportion of activities that align with the taxonomy's sustainability criteria.",
