      "question": "Why does the BayWa r.e. Group's CapEx qualify as taxonomy-aligned under the EU Taxonomy, and how do its investments in wind power and photovoltaic technology contribute to environmental sustainability?",
      "answer": "The CapEx is considered taxonomy-aligned because it supports environmentally sustainable activities, specifically electricity generation from wind power and photovoltaic technology, which align with the EU taxonomy's criteria.",
