      "question": "Why are activities such as building heavy fuel oil engines and components for fossil fuel extraction excluded from EU Taxonomy eligibility, and how do eligible activities meet sustainability criteria?",
      "answer": "Excluded activities, such as building heavy fuel oil engines and components for fossil fuel extraction and processing, are not aligned with the EU Taxonomy's sustainability criteria, unlike eligible activities that contribute to climate change mitigation.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006330:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
