      "question": "Why is the MLP Group's ongoing development of processes critical for achieving compliance with both the German Supply Chain Due Diligence Act (LkSG) and the EU Taxonomy's minimum protection criteria?",
      "answer": "The MLP Group is unable to document all requirements of the German Supply Chain Due Diligence Act (LkSG) at this time because it is still in the process of developing suitable processes and implementing necessary measures to ensure full compliance with the law, which came into effect in 2024.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
