      "question": "Why did the proportional share of taxonomy-aligned sales revenues decrease despite Vossloh's overall increase in taxonomy-aligned revenues, and how does this relate to EU Taxonomy reporting criteria?",
      "answer": "Although taxonomy-aligned sales revenues increased, their share fell marginally by 1 percentage point, likely due to a proportional increase in non-taxonomy-aligned revenues or other factors affecting the overall revenue composition.",
