      "question": "Why does the updated Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2485 shift focus away from certain economic activities, such as '3.6 Manufacture of other low carbon technologies,' in its disclosure requirements?",
      "answer": "Certain economic activities, such as '3.6 Manufacture of other low carbon technologies,' may no longer require disclosures because the updated regulation shifts focus to new or revised activities, reflecting changes in technical screening criteria and priorities.",
