      "question": "Why are additions from lease assets excluded from the CapEx plan in the vehicle-related business under the EU Taxonomy, and how does this decision align with the taxonomy's sustainability principles?",
      "answer": "Additions from lease assets, primarily from the vehicle leasing business, are based on existing environmentally sustainable activities and are therefore not included in the CapEx plan under the EU Taxonomy.",
