      "question": "Why must economic activities meet substantial contribution, DNSH, and minimum safeguards criteria to be taxonomy-aligned, and how do these requirements ensure alignment with EU sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "To be taxonomy-aligned, economic activities must make a substantial contribution to at least one of the six environmental objectives, not significantly harm other objectives (DNSH), and meet minimum safeguards related to human rights and social and labor standards.",
