      "question": "Why are projects like the 'Lithium-ion Battery Factory of the Future' supported under the Important Projects of Common European Interest (IPCEI), and how does this align with EU taxonomy objectives?",
      "answer": "The IPCEI aims to promote research and innovation in critical areas, such as the battery value chain, by supporting projects like the 'Lithium-ion Battery Factory of the Future' through governmental initiatives.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
