      "question": "Why did expenditures related to activity 7.6 increase significantly, and how does this investment in photovoltaic systems support the company's alignment with EU Taxonomy sustainability objectives?",
      "answer": "Expenditures for activity 7.6 increased from €6 million to €30 million due to a strong commitment to expanding photovoltaic systems, highlighting the company's focus on renewable energy technologies.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
