      "question": "Why are certain Wienerberger Group activities, such as pipe solutions and pavers, currently excluded from the EU Taxonomy Regulation, and what factors might influence their inclusion in the future?",
      "answer": "Activities such as the production of pipe solutions and pavers are currently excluded from the scope of the Taxonomy Regulation, although an extension of the scope is possible in the future.",
