      "question": "Why does the EU Taxonomy emphasize non-capitalized research and development in the operating expenditure for low-carbon technologies, and what does this reveal about its approach to sustainability?",
      "answer": "Nearly two-thirds of the operating expenditure for low-carbon technologies is dedicated to non-capitalized research and development to prioritize innovation and the development of sustainable technologies, aligning with the EU Taxonomy's environmental goals.",
