      "question": "Why is 2025 a pivotal year for CA Immo in the context of mandatory sustainability reporting under the EU Taxonomy Regulation, CSRD, and ESRS, and what challenges might arise during this transition?",
      "answer": "The year 2025 marks the start of mandatory reporting for CA Immo under the CSRD, ESRS, and EU Taxonomy Regulation, necessitating the company’s ongoing preparations to meet these binding requirements.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
