      "question": "Why does the Frequentis Group prioritize specific cost categories, such as research and development and maintenance, in its taxonomy-eligible operating expenditures under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "The focus on specific cost categories, such as research and development, short-term leases, and maintenance and repair of property, plant, and equipment, aligns with the requirements for taxonomy eligibility. These categories are likely chosen because they support sustainable economic activities under the EU Taxonomy framework.",
