      "question": "How does the EU Taxonomy framework influence the integration of responsible procurement management into non-financial statements, and why is this alignment significant for sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "Non-financial statements and responsible procurement management are interconnected as both aim to reflect an organization's commitment to sustainability, with procurement practices directly impacting the environmental disclosures in these statements.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
