      "question": "How does United Internet's reconciliation process at the Group level ensure the accuracy of Taxonomy-eligible KPIs and prevent double-counting, and why is this critical for EU Taxonomy compliance?",
      "answer": "United Internet reconciled the turnover, CapEx, and OpEx associated with Taxonomy-eligible activities with the relevant population at the Group level, which allowed for monitoring and prevention of potential double-counting.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
