      "question": "Why is adherence to international guidelines, such as the OECD Guidelines and UN Guiding Principles, critical for ensuring the sustainability and ethical compliance of taxonomy-aligned activities?",
      "answer": "Compliance with international guidelines, such as the OECD Guidelines and the UN Guiding Principles, ensures that taxonomy-aligned activities adhere to ethical, human rights, and labor standards, reinforcing their sustainability and social responsibility.",
