      "question": "Why did the TRATON GROUP's taxonomy-aligned capital expenditure change in 2023, and what does this reveal about the challenges of meeting EU Taxonomy criteria for pollution prevention and control?",
      "answer": "The change was largely due to buses meeting the Euro 6 Stage E standard no longer qualifying for substantial contribution criteria and the inability to provide evidence for the DNSH criterion for pollution prevention and control.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006387:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
