      "question": "How does the proportional share of OpEx for taxonomy eligible research projects support innovation within the EU Taxonomy framework, and why is this allocation important for sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "The proportional share of OpEx for taxonomy eligible research projects refers to the portion of operating expenses allocated to research activities that qualify under the taxonomy framework. This ensures alignment with sustainability goals.",
