      "question": "Why is compliance with Criterion a of the Climate Change Act, specifically the absence of artificial reservoirs, critical for hydroelectric power generation to be taxonomy-aligned under CCM 4.5?",
      "answer": "The absence of artificial reservoirs is significant because it fulfills Criterion a of the Climate Change Act, which specifies this requirement for hydroelectric power generation to be taxonomy-aligned.",
