      "question": "Why is the statutory corporation tax rate insufficient to determine the total tax burden in Germany, and how does this relate to EU Taxonomy-aligned governance and transparency in tax reporting?",
      "answer": "The statutory corporation tax rate of 15.0% is supplemented by trade tax and the solidarity surcharge, which together increase the total tax burden to an average of 30.1% in 2023.",
