      "question": "Why does Volkswagen prioritize extreme climate scenarios like RCP8.5 and SSP5-8.5 in its DNSH assessment, and how does this approach align with EU Taxonomy principles for sustainable activities?",
      "answer": "Volkswagen uses the RCP8.5 and SSP5-8.5 scenarios because they represent the highest concentration of CO2 according to the IPCC, allowing the company to evaluate risks under the most extreme climate conditions projected up to 2050.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "validation:000741:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
