      "question": "Why are uncertainties in the assurance engagement process inherent to the interpretation of undefined legal terms in the EU Taxonomy Regulation, and how do they impact sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "Uncertainties are inherent in the assurance engagement because the EU Taxonomy Regulation contains undefined legal terms, which require subjective interpretation by executive directors, leading to potential variability in legal conformity assessments.",
