ty in interpretation can lead to discrepancies in classification.\n\nTo address these challenges, companies like Zalando often work towards improving their internal processes, seeking clearer guidelines from regulatory bodies, and enhancing their data collection and reporting mechanisms. They may also engage with external experts to ensure compliance and alignment with evolving sustainability standards."
