      "answer": "analysts and banks, business partners, civil-society organizations (NGOs), customers, designers and architects, employees, investors, local authorities, local residents, media, organized interest groups, political decision-makers, real estate developers, regulators, representatives of the public administration, research institutions, suppliers, universities",
