      "question": "What preventative health and wellness measures are offered by BayWa and its subsidiaries to promote employee well-being?",
      "answer": "#socialandhealthy, back exercise, fatigue management, free face-to-face seminars, health management initiatives, healthy behaviour, improving resilience, interactive elements, managing stress, mindfulness, nutrition, online formats, online-based health programme, physiotherapists, preventative measures, psychological health, relaxation",
      "type": "Factoid",
