      "question": "Which demographic criteria are prioritized in the Addiko Group's recruitment and mobility policies to ensure compliance with ESG standards?",
      "answer": "age, citizenship, colour, ethnicity, gender, marital status, national origin, nationality, pregnancy, race, religion, sexual orientation",
