      "question": "Which groups does Manz engage with to address governance, social, and strategic priorities?",
      "answer": "analysts, associations, banks, customers, employees, investors, key stakeholder groups, players in science and research, politics at municipal, regional and European level, strategic partners, suppliers, the media",
