      "question": "Which criteria were evaluated during Uniper's 2023 audit to ensure fair compensation practices?",
      "answer": "2023 annual base salary, bonuses, certification audit, job-related characteristics, professional position, qualification-related employee characteristics, seniority, skill level, tolerance threshold of 5%, work experience",
