      "question": "What channels does the organization use to ensure tenant accessibility and engagement in alignment with ESG principles?",
      "answer": "44 tenant offices, TAG Wohnen website, analogue channels, email, notices posted in the buildings, online form, phone, social media such as Facebook and Instagram, tenant app, tenant newsletter, various brochures",
      "type": "Factoid",
