      "question": "Who are the stakeholder groups identified in relation to the bank's impact analysis and target setting process?",
      "answer": "academia, civil society institutions, clients, communities, customers, governments, investors, nonprofit organizations, regulators, representatives of indigenous population, suppliers",
      "type": "Factoid",
