      "question": "What proactive strategies are implemented at MTU to ensure workplace safety and compliance with ESG standards?",
      "answer": "Preventive workplace safety, emergency drills, emergency procedures, monthly inspections, proactive measures, quarterly workplace safety training, regular inspections, routine inspections of workplaces, shop-specific instruction, workplace inspections",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003571:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
