      "question": "Who are the key interest groups that influence Vonovia's ESG strategy?",
      "answer": "analysts, employees, investors, non-governmental organizations (NGOs), policymakers, service providers, shareholders, suppliers, tenants' associations, the media",
      "type": "Factoid",
