      "question": "What attributes does CA Immo protect to ensure diversity and inclusion in its workplace?",
      "answer": "age, disability of any kind, discrimination on the basis of gender, ethnicity, ideology, marital status, regional or social origin, religion, sexual orientation, skin color",
      "type": "Factoid",
