      "question": "What ethical and ESG principles are enforced by Scout24's Code of Conduct for suppliers and business partners?",
      "answer": "Code of Conduct, abuse, discrimination, forced labour, freedom of association, harassment, health and safety management practices, safe working environment",
      "type": "Factoid",
