      "question": "Which reports and disclosures provide insights into freenet AG's ESG-related performance and governance?",
      "answer": "14 Business model and organisational structure, 16 Corporate strategy and goals, 19 Corporate management, 2023 Annual report, 24 Economic environment, 27 Overview of the course of business, 38 Report on opportunities and risks, 49 Non-financial group statement, 84 Corporate governance and other disclosures",
      "type": "Factoid",
