      "question": "What initiatives are included in Vonovia's programs to promote sustainable neighborhood development?",
      "answer": "clean-up and planting campaigns, daycare centers, food banks, municipal neighborhood managers, neighborhood meetings, premises and services in kind, small art projects, social and cultural institutions, social institutions",
      "type": "Factoid",
