      "question": "Which governance documents form the foundation of Vonovia's compliance framework?",
      "answer": "Business Partner Code, Code of Conduct, Compliance guidelines, Donations and sponsorship guidelines, Group guidelines on guideline management, Inspection guidelines, Whistleblowing guidelines, guidelines to protect whistleblowers, new anti-corruption guidelines",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002697:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
