      "question": "Which ESG topics are addressed in United Internet's sustainability report as part of its compliance with CSR-RUG and GRI Standards?",
      "answer": "anti-corruption and bribery matters, data privacy, digital participation, employee-related matters, information security, material topics, respect for human rights, risk identification and mitigation, social matters",
