      "question": "Which financial instruments and services contribute to ESG net revenue as defined in the context?",
      "answer": "ESG indices, ETF licenses, climate benchmarks, contracts for green power, emission allowances, guarantee of origin services, power products, share of renewable energy production, sustainable commodity markets",
