      "answer": "UPS systems, cold aisle/hot aisle, electricity supply systems, energy-efficient climate control concepts, energy-saving smart server power supply units, free cooling, high efficiency levels, investigating and avoiding cooling short circuits, rack isolation",
      "type": "Factoid",
