      "question": "What activities along Evonik's value chain contribute to greenhouse gas emissions?",
      "answer": "business trips, capital goods, disposal of waste, employee commuting, energy requirements for administrative buildings, inbound and outbound shipments, production of purchased raw materials, services, use, disposal, and recycling of sold products",
