      "question": "Which initiatives does Wienerberger implement to enhance diversity and inclusion in its workforce?",
      "answer": "awareness building, central aspects of diversity, diverse talents, diversity and inclusion aspects, diversity in our teams, diversity of competencies, diversity of our customers, e-learning courses in diversity, intercultural training",
