      "question": "Which governance measures are implemented to ensure legal compliance by employees?",
      "answer": "Anti-corruption policy, Data Protection Code of Conduct, Data protection policy, Information security policy, Policy on capital market compliance, Policy on consequence management, Procurement policy, Signature policy, Tax policy",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
