      "question": "Which processes ensure compliance and sustainability in wastewater treatment at Marl Chemical Park?",
      "answer": "Evonik wastewater treatment facilities, dewatered in our own treatment plant, incinerated in our own facilities, integrated flue gas treatment, legislation on self-monitoring, measuring equipment that operates continuously, regular sampling, unannounced checks",
