      "answer": "14 Business model and organisational structure, 16 Corporate strategy and goals, 19 Corporate management, 24 Economic environment, 27 Overview of the course of business, 38 Report on opportunities and risks, 49 Non-financial group statement, 69 2023 Annual report",
