      "question": "What labor protections and workplace standards are outlined in the statement to support ESG compliance?",
      "answer": "fair compensation, freedom of association, prohibition of child labor, prohibition of forced labor, protection from discrimination, right to collective bargaining, safe and healthy workplaces, working hours",
      "type": "Factoid",
