      "question": "What features in myhive offices promote tenant well-being and align with IMMOFINANZ Group's social sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "attractive communication zones, common areas, cross-border myhive app, direct feedback tool, feel-good atmosphere, myhive offices, numerous services, tenant lounges",
      "type": "Factoid",
