      "question": "Which risks related to human rights and labor conditions are flagged as critical in Hapag-Lloyd's supply chain analysis?",
      "answer": "child labour, discrimination, forced labour, human rights aspects, human rights due diligence, living wage, occupational health and safety, use of violence",
      "type": "Factoid",
