      "question": "What topics related to human rights are addressed by the company's overarching directive in alignment with ESG principles?",
      "answer": "clinical studies, collective bargaining, equal opportunity, exclusion of child and forced labor, fair pay, freedom of association, occupational health and safety, product safety",
      "type": "Factoid",
