      "question": "Which initiatives at Volkswagen AG promote work-life balance through flexible arrangements?",
      "answer": "Meine AusZeit, combination of remote working and working onsite, flexible working hours, flextime, self-financed leave of absence, shift models, variable part-time work, working time accounts",
      "type": "Factoid",
