      "question": "What governance activities are included in the compliance management system to support ESG objectives in the KION Group?",
      "answer": "advises on sanctions, cases of non-compliance, compliance management system, compliance training conducted locally, donations and sponsorship activities, integrity check, manages investigations, potential compliance violations",
      "type": "Factoid",
