        "subtitles": [
          "Direct GHG emissions (Scope 1)"
        ],
        "paragraph": "The Zumtobel Group uses natural gas for the production processes of heating and coating. The company vehicles and emergency power generators operate with liquid fossil fuels. Various refrigerants are also used in the cooling systems. The 2021/22 financial year was defined as the reference year because the full scope of data on the production locations has been recorded since that time.\nThe applied emission factors are provided by the suppliers. The direct greenhouse gas emissions in tonnes equal the energy consumption in MWh multiplied by the relevant emission factor in tonnes per MWh.\nScope 1 CO<sub>2</sub>e emissions totalled 7,451 t in 2023/24, which means an absolute reduction of 6% below the previous year (7,892 t).",
        "classification": "ESG",
        "report_name": "Zumtobel_Group_AG.pdf"
      },
      "spans": {
