      "question": "Which components of the Group Compliance function's portfolio contribute to governance and risk management in ESG?",
      "answer": "Case Management, Compliance Committee/Forums, Continuous Improvement, Monitoring & Reporting, Policies & Procedures, Programs & Tools, Risk Assessment, Training & Awareness",
      "type": "Factoid",
