      "question": "Which policies are relevant for mitigating environmental and social risks in financial portfolios?",
      "answer": "exclusion policies for certain sectors/activities, gender-related policies, national guidelines related to social risks, social due diligence policies, stakeholder engagement policies, whistle-blower policies, zero-deforestation policies, zero-tolerance policies",
      "type": "Factoid",
