      "question": "Which principles of the UN Global Compact address social issues that Siltronic has committed to comply with?",
      "answer": "Principle 1, Principle 2, Principle 3, Principle 4, Principle 5, Principle 6, ten principles of the UN Global Compact",
      "type": "Factoid",
