      "question": "What communication formats are used to align risk management with ESG governance at Bechtle?",
      "answer": "committees, effective continuous communication, hierarchical levels, informal management meetings, management and strategy meetings, planning and individual discussions, systemic connection with the operating business, teamwork formats",
