      "question": "Which principles and measures in IMMOFINANZ's anti-corruption directive address ethical conduct and conflict prevention?",
      "answer": "acceptance and granting of benefits, consultants and intermediaries, dealing with public officials, definition of corruption, donations and sponsoring, gifts and benefits, use of intermediaries",
