      "question": "What are the key features of the deferred compensation plan that promote financial sustainability and employee welfare within Deutsche Börse Group?",
      "answer": "benefit assets of equal value, capital payment, convert portions of future remuneration entitlements, earlier date due to disability or death, employee-funded deferred compensation plan, equal annual instalments, interest of 6 per cent p.a.",
      "type": "Factoid",
