      "question": "What initiatives does PALFINGER implement to promote employee development and diversity within its ESG framework?",
      "answer": "attracting and retaining experts, diversity concept, employee development, equal opportunities, increasing diversity, promotion of qualified employees, training and continued education",
      "type": "Factoid",
