      "question": "Which financial instruments are structured under Hapag-Lloyd's framework for advancing environmentally compatible transport?",
      "answer": "Green Debt Instruments, Green Financing Framework, Sustainability-Linked Bond Framework, debt instruments, loans and leasing contracts, sustainability-linked bond, sustainability-linked revolving credit facilities",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002926:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
