      "question": "Which governance areas are covered by the Frequentis Security Organisation to ensure compliance and resilience?",
      "answer": "Group-wide Security Governance, IT Security, Managed Supplier Security, Personnel Security, Physical Security, Service Security, System Security",
      "type": "Factoid",
