      "question": "Which accessibility features are reviewed to ensure compliance with ESG standards in new builds in Poland?",
      "answer": "Braille signage in lifts, disabled bathroom, spacious bathrooms, switches at lower heights, thresholds, voice announcements, wider doorways",
      "type": "Factoid",
