      "question": "Which training programs are essential for ESG compliance in LNG-powered vessel operations?",
      "answer": "30-day practical component, IGF advanced (IGF II), IGF basic (IGF I), advanced IGF certificate, suitable training in 2023, targeted safety training, theory-based modules",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003537:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
