      "question": "What valuation methods are applied to ensure fair governance in SBP stock option pricing?",
      "answer": "Xetra closing price, average share price, closing auction price, current market price, fair value measurement, number of stock options, option pricing model",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003739:qa_pairs_factoid:0011",
