      "question": "What initiatives does UNIQA implement to enhance employee well-being and align with its sustainability strategy?",
      "answer": "employee well-being, flexible working hours, health of our employees, options for working from home, social events on a regular basis, state's social systems, work-life balance",
      "type": "Factoid",
