      "question": "How does the TAKKT Code of Ethics contribute to ESG principles through its outlined ethical guidelines?",
      "answer": "Antitrust & competition law, Dealing with conflicts of interest, Fair employment practices, No corruption, Protection of assets & information, Respect for the law, Responsibility towards the environment & society",
