      "question": "What training initiatives are included in the ANDRITZ management system to promote safety and career development?",
      "answer": "annual safety training schedule, behavior-based safety principles, career development, health and safety training courses, online training on safety in the workplace, refresher course every two years, specific modules",
      "type": "Factoid",
