      "question": "Which labor-related risks are addressed by the SMA Group's due diligence process?",
      "answer": "child labor, discrimination, forced labor and human trafficking, freedom of association and assembly, general working conditions, occupational health and safety, wages and remuneration",
      "type": "Factoid",
