      "question": "Which mandatory training courses are implemented to enhance occupational health and safety awareness across the Group?",
      "answer": "Safety Certificate Contractors, Safety Check Card, first aid courses, good practice, introductory training sessions, knowledge check, safety alerts",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004649:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
