      "question": "What challenges are identified in FWAG's capital expenditure projects that could affect sustainability and resource efficiency?",
      "answer": "capex projects, changes in planning, construction manual, higher construction costs, intended expenditure, loss of suppliers, pre-project phase",
      "type": "Factoid",
