      "question": "Which legal and regulatory frameworks ensure the Supervisory Board's adherence to governance and corporate responsibility standards?",
      "answer": "AktG, GCGC, German Stock Corporation Act, SE Regulation, SEAG, SEBG",
      "type": "Factoid",
