      "question": "Which measures and processes are tracked by Uniper SE's Board of Management to ensure sustainability strategy implementation?",
      "answer": "ESG Risk Management process, ESG risk management, ESG-related risks and opportunities, Group-wide ESG targets, Group-wide sustainability strategy, climate-related risks, strategic ESG activities",
      "type": "Factoid",
