      "question": "Which meetings are part of the governance framework for coordinating HR, safety, and project management processes?",
      "answer": "monthly management meetings, monthly steering group session, quarterly controlling, steering committee meetings, steering groups, supra-regional organisation group, team meetings",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:005406:qa_pairs_factoid:0009",
