      "question": "What programs at AMAG enhance employee skills and align with sustainable workforce development?",
      "answer": "CIP group spokespersons, Learning Quarter, apprentice coach, apprenticeships more attractive at AMAG, integration of AMAG components into training and development operations, new training centre, training formats for shift leaders",
      "type": "Factoid",
