      "question": "Which ESRS standards related to environmental topics are classified as non-material for Addiko's operations?",
      "answer": "ESRS E2 Pollution, ESRS E3 Water and marine resources, ESRS E4 Biodiversity and ecosystems, ESRS E5 Circular economy",
