      "question": "What criteria does Uniper emphasize to enhance employee satisfaction and attract skilled workers?",
      "answer": "New Work, attractiveness criteria, career opportunities, career websites, press coverage, rating portals, sustainability",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
