      "question": "What international frameworks and principles guide the Zumtobel Group's ESG commitments?",
      "answer": "10 principles of the UN Global Compact, ILO Declaration on Fundamental Principles and Rights at Work, OECD Guidelines for Multinational Enterprises, UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights, Universal Declaration of Human Rights",
