      "question": "What timeframes are considered in Evonik's ESG-aligned risk management strategies for assessing opportunities and risks?",
      "answer": "long-term risks and opportunities, mid-term period, mid-term plan, present business plan, present fiscal year, three-year period",
      "type": "Factoid",
