      "question": "Which departments at PORR are responsible for implementing climate-related strategies and monitoring sustainability targets?",
      "answer": "Corporate Environmental Management, Corporate Sustainability, Group Controlling, Group Procurement, Operational Management, Risk Management",
      "type": "Factoid",
