      "question": "Why were the European Code of Conduct on Data Centre Energy Efficiency, the German Act on Corporate Due Diligence Obligations in Supply Chains (LkSG), and the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) prioritized in the company's 2023 sustainability activities?",
      "answer": "Key focuses in 2023 included implementing the European Code of Conduct on Data Centre Energy Efficiency, integrating the principles of the German Act on Corporate Due Diligence Obligations in Supply Chains (LkSG) into company processes and risk management, and preparing for extended reporting obligations under the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) effective from 2024.",
