      "question": "Why are the legal and professional standards, such as the By-laws Regulating the Rights and Duties of Wirtschaftsprüfer and vereidigte Buchprüfer and the IDW Quality Assurance Standard (IDW QS 1), significant for ensuring ESG compliance in audit practices?",
      "answer": "The audit firm adheres to national legal requirements, professional pronouncements, the By-laws Regulating the Rights and Duties of Wirtschaftsprüfer and vereidigte Buchprüfer, and the IDW Quality Assurance Standard (IDW QS 1). These standards ensure compliance with ethical requirements, professional standards, and statutory obligations, which are critical for maintaining a robust quality management system.",
