      "question": "Why is there a significant disparity in the average length of service between commercial and industrial employees at TAG in Germany, and how might this relate to ESG considerations such as workplace conditions or employee engagement strategies?",
      "answer": "Commercial employees at TAG in Germany have an average length of service of around ten years, which is approximately twice as long as the five-year average for industrial employees. This highlights a significant disparity between the two groups.",
