      "question": "Why are processing of sold products (3.10), use of sold products (3.11), and end-of-life treatment of sold products (3.12) excluded from BayWa's Scope 3 emissions reporting for 2023 despite their identification in the 2022 materiality analysis?",
      "answer": "Categories identified in BayWa's 2022 materiality analysis but not reported for the 2023 financial year include processing of sold products (3.10), use of sold products (3.11), and end-of-life treatment of sold products (3.12).",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
