      "question": "Why does Wienerberger use diverse methods like videos, on-site training, e-learning, and simulation exercises to communicate its information security policy, and how does this reflect its commitment to ESG governance and employee engagement?",
      "answer": "Wienerberger communicates its information security policy to employees through various methods, including videos, on-site training, e-learning, and simulation exercises. These approaches ensure that employees are well-informed about the policy and its requirements.",
