      "question": "Why is it important for the Clean & Hygiene guideline to address both contamination prevention and the creation of conditions that inherently reduce contamination risks, particularly in the context of ESG compliance and stakeholder trust?",
      "answer": "The context implies that the guideline has a comprehensive scope, focusing not only on preventing contamination but also on creating conditions through design and maintenance that inherently reduce contamination risks.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
