      "question": "Why did lower production volumes in 2023 contribute to a reduction in absolute indirect CO<sub>2</sub> emissions from electricity, and what does this reveal about the relationship between operational activity and environmental impact?",
      "answer": "The reduction in absolute indirect CO<sub>2</sub> emissions from electricity in 2023 was influenced by notably lower production volumes compared to 2020. This suggests a direct link between production activity levels and energy-related emissions.",
