      "question": "Why is it essential for the SYZYGY GROUP to address skillset development in response to technological innovation and evolving user behavior, and how does this align with ESG principles of adaptability and workforce sustainability?",
      "answer": "Ensuring employees keep their skillsets up to date addresses challenges posed by innovative technologies and changes in user behavior, enabling them to remain effective and adaptable in a dynamic work environment.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003797:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
