      "question": "Why are sustainable digitalization, data privacy, combating fake information, adapting to the changing world of work, and transitioning to a decarbonized economy critical challenges in United Internet's ESG transformation process?",
      "answer": "United Internet is addressing challenges such as sustainable digitalization, data privacy, combating fake information on the internet, adapting to the changing world of work, and transitioning to a decarbonized economy as part of its sustainability transformation.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
