      "question": "Why does the lower production volume in components plants impact the Zumtobel Group's ability to meet greenhouse gas emissions intensity targets, and what does this reveal about production scalability in sustainability planning?",
      "answer": "The lower production volume in components plants contributed to the Zumtobel Group not meeting its emissions intensity target for 2022/23, highlighting the impact of production scale on achieving sustainability goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002832:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0010",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
