      "question": "Why does the consolidation of more than 50% of shares or voting rights trigger the loss of tax loss carryforwards under German corporate tax law, and how does this impact governance and shareholder decision-making at freenet AG?",
      "answer": "The legal consequences include the loss of negative income, specifically corporate income tax and trade tax loss carryforwards, that had not been offset or deducted prior to the consolidation.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002870:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0008",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
