      "question": "Why did the commissioning of the new dispersion plant in Nanjing, China, lead to a rise in Groupwide emissions of volatile organic compounds (NMVOCs), and what implications does this have for the Group's environmental strategy?",
      "answer": "The increase in Groupwide emissions of volatile organic compounds (NMVOCs) by 3 percent year over year was attributed to the commissioning of a new dispersion plant in Nanjing, China.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
