      "question": "Why are stringent organizational measures essential for AMAG Austria Metall AG to ensure compliance with legal requirements in financial accounting and reporting, and how do these measures align with ESG governance principles?",
      "answer": "AMAG ensures compliance with legal requirements through appropriate organizational measures that guarantee complete, correct, timely, and orderly entries in books and records. This process is governed by stringent regulations and guidelines covering all steps from procurement to payment.",
