      "question": "Why are the UNIQA Group's efforts to reduce the pay gap and promote diversity significant for advancing ESG goals, and what broader impacts might these efforts have on organizational sustainability and societal expectations?",
      "answer": "The efforts demonstrate the UNIQA Group's commitment to fostering equity and inclusion, which can enhance employee satisfaction, improve organizational performance, and align with broader societal expectations for corporate responsibility.",
