      "question": "Why are the STRATEC Group’s flexible working hours and mobile work options critical for addressing childcare-related challenges, and how do these measures align with ESG priorities like employee well-being and social equity?",
      "answer": "The STRATEC Group addresses childcare-related challenges by offering flexible working hours and mobile work options, particularly during times when childcare services are unavailable. These measures ensure that employees can fulfill both work and family obligations effectively.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
