      "question": "Why does TAG prioritize processing 92% of investment volume in comprehensive modernization measures through framework agreement partners, and how does this strategy support their governance and operational efficiency goals?",
      "answer": "Around 92% of the investment volume in comprehensive modernization measures is processed using framework agreement partners. This high percentage reflects TAG's strategic focus on building long-term partnerships to streamline operations.",
