      "question": "Why were business travel emissions from the subsidiaries Our datac Kommunikationssysteme GmbH and q.beyond logineer GmbH excluded from the 2021 climate balance sheet, and how does this align with ESG materiality principles?",
      "answer": "Business travel emissions from these subsidiaries were excluded due to materiality considerations, as they were included in the financial year for the first time in 2021.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004368:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0001",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
