      "question": "Why is the profitability of growth emphasized as a pillar of Deutsche Börse AG's corporate strategy, and how does this focus contribute to ESG objectives like sustainable economic performance and stakeholder value creation?",
      "answer": "Profitability of growth is emphasized to ensure that the company not only achieves absolute growth but also maintains sustainable and efficient financial performance. This strategic focus is reflected in the use of EBITDA as a key performance indicator.",
