      "question": "Why might the deviation in materiality definitions between the German Commercial Code (HGB) and frameworks like GRI or the German Sustainability Code shape the Company's ESG reporting strategy and stakeholder communication?",
      "answer": "The deviation in materiality definitions likely prompts the Company to avoid full adoption of external frameworks, instead using them as guidelines to ensure compliance with the HGB while leveraging the frameworks' insights.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
