      "question": "Why are the independence and quality assurance requirements, such as those outlined in the Professional Code for German Public Auditors and Chartered Accountants and the IDW QMS 1, critical for ESG-related audit practices?",
      "answer": "The context references the independence and quality assurance requirements outlined in national legal provisions and professional pronouncements. These include the Professional Code for German Public Auditors and Chartered Accountants and the IDW Standard on Quality Management 1 (IDW QMS 1). These requirements ensure the integrity and reliability of audit practices.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:005177:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0001",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
