      "question": "Why does PALFINGER prioritize integrating UN Global Compact principles into its sustainability reporting over publishing a separate Communication on Progress report, and how does this approach align with its ESG strategy?",
      "answer": "PALFINGER links its sustainability topics to the UN Global Compact principles to integrate these principles directly into its sustainability reporting, ensuring alignment with its broader strategic goals and avoiding the need for a separate Communication on Progress report.",
