      "question": "Why are work-life balance strategies for parents essential for fostering employee well-being and productivity, and how do these initiatives align with ESG principles such as social sustainability and governance practices?",
      "answer": "The company offers proven strategies for mastering work-life balance, enabling parents to manage their professional responsibilities alongside their personal and family commitments more effectively.",
