      "question": "Why is it important for employees to refer to the 'Business conduct' chapter for the Global Code of Business Conduct and the Global Supplier Code of Conduct, and how does this support governance within the Lenzing Group?",
      "answer": "Employees should refer to the 'Business conduct' chapter for information on the Global Code of Business Conduct and the Global Supplier Code of Conduct.",
