      "question": "Why does the wide range of possible target achievement for Performance Shares based on TSR underscore Deutsche Börse's ESG-aligned approach to incentivizing exceptional performance and mitigating underperformance risks?",
      "answer": "The possible target achievement for the final number of Performance Shares based on TSR ranges from 0 percent to 250 percent. This wide range underscores the emphasis on rewarding exceptional performance while withholding rewards for underperformance.",
