      "question": "Why is the integration of the inside-out dimension into the internal risk management system significant for ESG compliance, and how will consolidating it into a single control system enhance sustainability governance?",
      "answer": "The organization plans to integrate the inside-out dimension into its internal risk management system and consolidate it into a single internal control system by the first half of 2024.",
