      "question": "Why does the organization publish specific reports like the UK Modern Slavery Statement, Merck Australia Modern Slavery Statement, and Norway Transparency Statement, and how do these contribute to its ESG commitments?",
      "answer": "The organization publishes the UK Modern Slavery Statement, the Merck Australia Modern Slavery Statement, and, starting in 2023, the Norway Transparency Statement.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004588:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0003",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
