      "question": "How does the company address human rights and environmental risks at its non-European location in India, and why are corruption, occupational safety, working hours, and discrimination prioritized in its ESG strategy?",
      "answer": "At its non-European location in India, the company pays special attention to compliance with human rights-related and environment-related guidelines, focusing on abstract risk topics such as corruption, occupational safety, working hours, and discrimination.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
