      "question": "Why does the revision of the Policy Statement on Social Responsibility and Human Rights represent a significant step in aligning the company’s ESG policies with regulatory requirements and risk prevention strategies?",
      "answer": "The revision signifies the company’s ongoing commitment to strengthening its approach to human rights and environmental protection. It reflects an effort to align policies with due diligence requirements and enhance risk prevention mechanisms.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003442:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0014",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
