      "question": "How does the company ensure adherence to laws, regulations, and ethical standards across its business activities, and why is extending compliance management to suppliers and sales parties critical for ESG governance?",
      "answer": "The company ensures that all business activities adhere to relevant laws, regulations, and ethical standards. It extends its compliance management beyond its own operations to include suppliers and interactions with sales parties such as commercial agents, distributors, and dealers.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003502:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
