      "question": "Why is the manager's proactive initiative in supporting employees during the 'development dialogue' process important for advancing ESG-related goals such as employee empowerment and sustainable leadership practices?",
      "answer": "Managers are encouraged to take initiative in supporting employees by proactively helping them achieve their learning targets. This involves acting as a coach and providing resources or guidance to facilitate the employee's development journey.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
