      "question": "Why is the development of a skills matrix for agile business processes under the DACH30 initiative important for Volkswagen’s ESG objectives, particularly in fostering employee adaptability and governance innovation?",
      "answer": "The skills matrix, developed under the DACH30 initiative, provides a structured framework for training and professional development in agile business processes, enabling Volkswagen to enhance employee adaptability and entrepreneurial skills.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "validation:000402:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0010",
