      "question": "Why does the Supervisory Board of MLP SE prioritize addressing gender representation during personnel changes rather than implementing immediate measures, and how does this approach reflect governance considerations?",
      "answer": "It is not possible to report on concrete measures because the implementation deadline for achieving the target is set for the end of the financial year 2025, and the Supervisory Board plans to address the objective during personnel changes rather than through immediate actions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
