      "question": "Why does the defined benefit pension agreement provide 60 percent of the transitional payment to the spouse of a deceased Executive Board member, and how does this reflect social responsibility under ESG principles?",
      "answer": "If an Executive Board member dies, their spouse is entitled to receive 60 percent of the transitional payment that would have been provided to the Executive Board member.",
