      "answer": "Executive Board members receive fringe benefits that include an appropriate company car for both business and personal use, taxable contributions towards private pensions, and appropriate insurance coverage such as accident insurance. These benefits are contractually agreed upon and are part of their compensation package.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
