      "question": "Why is the relationship between management and employee representatives at WACKER described as 'close and constructive,' and how does this collaboration advance ESG principles in governance and employee well-being?",
      "answer": "The relationship is described as 'close and constructive' because it fosters dialogue that results in innovative company agreements, aligning with the interests of employees and contributing to a collaborative work environment.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002761:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
      "difficulty_f1": 1.0,
