      "question": "Why is it important for '225 Economic standards' to ensure the financial viability of '229 Environmental standards' initiatives within the ESG framework, and how might this influence long-term sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "'225 Economic standards' might influence the implementation of '229 Environmental standards' by ensuring that environmental initiatives are economically viable and integrated into sustainable financial practices.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002920:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0011",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
