      "answer": "Least developed countries may face economic and infrastructural challenges in aligning with TRIPS provisions, which is why the deadline for compliance has been extended to 2033.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003327:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0011",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
