      "question": "Why does the SMA Group prioritize offering employment opportunities to trainees after vocational training, and how does this practice align with its ESG commitment to workforce retention and social responsibility?",
      "answer": "Following cooperative vocational training, trainees at the SMA Group have the possibility of further employment within the organization, aligning with the company's commitment to professional development and retention.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
