      "question": "Why is the inclusion of ESG-relevant topics in CA Immo's satisfaction survey significant for aligning workforce well-being with sustainable business practices, and how might this influence organizational strategy?",
      "answer": "Including ESG-relevant topics in the satisfaction survey is important as it aligns workforce satisfaction with broader environmental, social, and governance goals, ensuring that employee well-being is integrated into sustainable and ethical business practices.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:005714:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
