      "question": "Why are climate change mitigation, adaptation, resource efficiency, circular economy, biodiversity, human rights, gender equality, and decent employment considered critical pillars of ESG strategy in the context?",
      "answer": "The context emphasizes climate change mitigation, climate change adaptation, resource efficiency and circular economy, biodiversity, human rights, gender equality, and decent employment as key areas of focus for ESG considerations.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
