      "question": "Why is it important for the combined separate non-financial report to include both the consolidated non-financial group statement and the parent company's non-financial statement in the context of ESG reporting?",
      "answer": "The combined separate non-financial report includes the consolidated non-financial group statement of COMMERZBANK Aktiengesellschaft and the parent company's non-financial statement.",
