      "question": "Why are exchange rate differences from translating financial statements excluded from the sensitivity analysis, and how does this decision align with ESG principles of focused financial reporting and governance?",
      "answer": "Exchange rate differences from translating financial statements into the group's currency are excluded to focus the analysis solely on the direct impact of exchange rate changes on financial assets, liabilities, and hedges.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "validation:000395:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
