      "question": "Why is Hapag-Lloyd unable to demonstrate compliance with the minimum safeguard requirements for 2023, and what does this reveal about the challenges of implementing ESG-aligned processes across the value chain?",
      "answer": "Hapag-Lloyd faces the challenge of not having the due diligence processes fully implemented for the entire financial year 2023. As a result, compliance proof can only begin from 2024 onwards.",
