      "question": "Why is categorizing training hours by employee category and department critical for advancing the Group's ESG objectives, such as equitable access to development opportunities and effective resource allocation?",
      "answer": "Categorizing training hours by employee category and department allows the Group to tailor educational initiatives to specific needs and track progress effectively across different segments of the organization.",
