      "question": "Why is it essential for the company to track both incidents and illnesses in its occupational safety metrics, and how does this dual approach align with ESG principles of employee well-being and accountability?",
      "answer": "Tracking both incidents and illnesses provides a comprehensive view of workplace risks, addressing immediate safety concerns and long-term health impacts. This dual focus ensures a holistic approach to employee well-being and aligns with sustainable safety practices.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
