        ],
        "paragraph": "In Scope 3, categories 3.1, 3.2, 3.10 and 3.11 are relevant for us. The other upstream and downstream categories together account for less than 10 percent of total Scope 3 emissions.\nThe ratio of sales to the sum of greenhouse gas emissions from Scope 1, Scope 2, Scope 3 upstream and Scope 3 downstream is as follows. On average in 2023, sales of EUR 1.0 million were accompanied by 2,604 tons of  $CO<sub>2</sub>$  eq (previous year: 1,591 tons of  $CO<sub>2</sub>$  eq); in relation to Scope 1 and 2, this resulted in 168 tons of CO<sub>2</sub> per EUR 1.0 million of sales (previous year: 152).",
