      "question": "Why are mechanical processing methods like milling and drilling at AMAG sites essential for achieving both the precision required in aircraft manufacturing and the sustainability goals of the aviation industry?",
      "answer": "Mechanical processing methods like milling and drilling are significant because they enable the precise shaping and finishing of aluminum and hard metal components, ensuring they meet the exact specifications required for use in the aircraft industry.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
