      "question": "Why do legal, economic, and fiscal differences across countries lead to diverse retirement benefit systems, and how does this variability impact global governance and social responsibility in employee benefits?",
      "answer": "Retirement benefit systems may differ due to variations in legal, economic, and fiscal circumstances in each country, which shape the specific provisions offered to employees.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "validation:000302:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
