      "question": "Why is the process of defining goals within the talent management framework critical for ensuring alignment with Lenzing's ESG-driven strategic objectives, such as sustainable growth and resource optimization?",
      "answer": "The guideline explains how goals are defined to align employee efforts with Lenzing's strategic objectives, ensuring clarity and direction in performance expectations.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "test:000305:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
