      "question": "Why do companies like SUSS MicroTec view participation in ESG-related programs such as the CDP as essential for demonstrating sustainability leadership and aligning with evolving market and regulatory demands?",
      "answer": "Companies participate in ESG-related programs to demonstrate their commitment to sustainability, gain independent evaluations of their performance, and identify areas for improvement to meet regulatory and investor expectations.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "test:000463:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0011",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
