      "question": "Why is it important for Westwing employees to have access to supervisors and the Legal team for anti-corruption compliance support, and how does this align with ESG principles of accountability and governance?",
      "answer": "Westwing employees can consult their supervisors and the Legal team for support regarding anti-corruption compliance, ensuring they have access to guidance and assistance in adhering to the policy.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004318:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
