      "question": "Why are the specified targets under Section 76 (4) and Section 111 (5) AktG important for achieving ESG-aligned governance objectives, and how does the Corporate Governance Declaration track their attainment?",
      "answer": "The declaration specifies targets according to Section 76 (4) and Section 111 (5) AktG and includes disclosures on the attainment of these targets, reflecting the company's commitment to achieving its governance objectives.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
