      "question": "Why are online training formats, particularly those introduced during the pandemic, critical for advancing the company's social sustainability goals and ensuring equitable access to development opportunities?",
      "answer": "Online formats, particularly those introduced during the pandemic, play a significant role by providing accessible, cost-free training opportunities that employees have utilized intensively, thereby enriching the overall training ecosystem.",
