      "question": "Why are the sustainable development goals 'Good Health and Well-Being,' 'Gender Equality,' 'Decent Work and Economic Growth,' and 'Climate Action' significant to Addiko's ESG strategy and business operations?",
      "answer": "Addiko has identified 'Good Health and Well-Being' (3), 'Gender Equality' (5), 'Decent Work and Economic Growth' (8), and 'Climate Action' (13) as crucial because these goals align with its business operations and reflect its commitment to sustainability.",
