      "question": "Why are international assignment opportunities critical for fostering a globally diverse workforce, and how do they contribute to the company’s long-term ESG objectives, such as innovation and sustainability?",
      "answer": "Long-term organizational benefits include fostering a workforce with diverse perspectives, enhancing global collaboration, and building a culture of adaptability and innovation, all of which contribute to the company’s competitive edge and sustainability goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
