      "question": "Why is training experts and leaders from African countries through the 'Afrika kommt!' program essential for advancing ESG objectives like inclusive economic growth and cross-border governance collaboration?",
      "answer": "Training experts and leaders is significant as it builds a foundation for economic cooperation, empowering individuals to act as regional partners and strengthen Germany-Africa relations.",
