      "question": "Why are occupational safety and human rights in the supply chain voluntarily included in the non-financial statement, and how does this decision reflect ESG reporting principles and stakeholder transparency?",
      "answer": "These topics are included on a voluntary basis to ensure consistent reporting, even though they are no longer considered material based on the ESRS method.",
