      "question": "Why are ANDRITZ's products pivotal for advancing ESG objectives, and how do their contributions to decarbonization, the circular economy, and environmental protection align with global sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "ANDRITZ's products contribute to decarbonization (e.g., renewable energy, e-mobility, green hydrogen), the circular economy (e.g., recycling technologies), and environmental protection (e.g., air pollution prevention, water treatment). These areas currently account for 45% of the company's revenue, with plans to expand further.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002599:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
