      "question": "Why was the implementation package launched in prioritised countries during the past financial year instead of adopting a simultaneous global rollout, and how does this align with ESG governance principles?",
      "answer": "The implementation package was launched in the past financial year in prioritised countries to allow for a phased approach, enabling focused initial efforts and refinement before extending the rollout to other regions in 2024.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
