      "question": "Why is a holistic approach to ESG materiality analysis, which includes both direct and indirect impacts, crucial for aligning organizational practices with sustainability goals and stakeholder expectations?",
      "answer": "Considering both direct and indirect impacts ensures a holistic approach to ESG analysis, capturing the full scope of an organization’s influence and enabling better strategic decision-making regarding sustainability and risk management.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003228:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0003",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
