      "question": "Why are differences between the calculated and actual return on plan assets recognised in other comprehensive income, and how does this practice ensure accountability in ESG-aligned pension fund management?",
      "answer": "Differences between the calculated and actual return on plan assets are recognised in other comprehensive income in the period they arise.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003271:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
