      "question": "Why is it essential for the fixed portion of the MLP Executive Board's compensation to avoid significant dependency on the variable portion in the context of ESG-aligned governance and sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "Avoiding significant dependency on the variable portion ensures financial stability for board members and reduces the pressure to prioritize short-term performance over long-term sustainability, aligning with the company's strategic goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003965:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
