      "answer": "The largely positive feedback in the People Survey suggests that Deutsche Börse Group's workplace strategy effectively addresses employee needs. It indicates that their initiatives, such as flexible work models and support for personal development, resonate well with employees and contribute to a positive perception of the company.",
