      "question": "Why are international assignments a vital component of TAKKT's employee development strategy, and how do they support the company's ESG objectives of fostering global collaboration and cultural integration?",
      "answer": "International assignments are important because they provide employees with exposure to diverse work environments and cultures, fostering adaptability and global perspectives. These experiences enhance personal and professional growth, which is crucial for TAKKT's goal of building an integrated international company.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
