      "question": "Why are nutrition and physical activity initiatives, such as free fruit deliveries and bike-to-work campaigns, important for advancing the KION Group's ESG goals related to employee health and productivity?",
      "answer": "The KION Group promotes employee health through initiatives such as free fruit deliveries and bike-to-work campaigns, which encourage healthy eating and physical activity.",
