      "question": "Why is the Zumtobel Group's preparation for the Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive (CSDDD) significant in the context of ESG compliance, and what steps were taken to address its requirements?",
      "answer": "The Zumtobel Group addressed the requirements of the CSDDD as part of its compliance efforts by making specific preparations to meet the directive's standards, which contributed to achieving its 2023/24 compliance goals.",
