      "question": "Why is information related to the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) excluded from the limited assurance engagement under ISAE 300 rev, and what implications does this have for Uniper's ESG transparency?",
      "answer": "Information regarding the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) is not part of the limited assurance engagement performed in accordance with ISAE 300 rev, indicating it is outside the scope of the assurance process.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
