      "question": "Why does Deutsche Börse AG's decision to voluntarily publish speeches by the Chairs of the Executive and Supervisory Boards ahead of the AGM align with ESG principles, particularly governance transparency?",
      "answer": "The company published these speeches ahead of the AGM to maximise transparency and provide shareholders with equal access to important information, aligning with its corporate communication principles.",
