      "question": "Why is it critical for the CEO to promptly report matters of special importance to the Supervisory Board, and how does this practice align with governance standards and ESG compliance at Deutsche Börse AG?",
      "answer": "The CEO is required to report promptly to ensure that the Supervisory Board is informed of critical developments and can provide timely oversight and guidance on issues that significantly impact the company.",
