      "question": "Why are internet threats considered one of the largest risk groups for United Internet, and how does addressing these risks align with its ESG priorities for operational integrity and stakeholder security?",
      "answer": "Internet threats are considered one of the largest risk groups due to their significant potential impact on United Internet’s reputation, operational integrity, and the security of customer data.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004064:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
