      "question": "Why might the increasing reliance on leasing personnel, as reflected in the rising leasing personnel ratio, influence the POLYTEC GROUP's long-term workforce sustainability and social governance practices?",
      "answer": "The increase in leasing personnel ratio from 9.1% to 12.4% suggests a growing reliance on temporary or flexible staffing solutions, which could impact workforce stability, cost management, and long-term employee development strategies.",
