      "question": "Why does the Supervisory Board's adoption of the STOXX® Europe 600 Industrial Goods & Services as a benchmark strengthen ESG-related transparency and comparability in capital market performance evaluation?",
      "answer": "The use of the STOXX® Europe 600 Industrial Goods & Services enhances the evaluation by providing a broader and more stable comparison group of similar companies, ensuring relevance and facilitating public verification of performance metrics.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
