        "paragraph": "For some of our existing high-quality products, we offer second brands at affordable prices, particularly in countries with a large percentage of low-income patients. For example, second brands for the betablocker bisoprolol (Concor®) are available at affordable prices in Brazil, Chile, Peru, Poland, and South Africa. The same applies to levothyroxine (Euthyrox®) in Brazil and Mexico, and to metformin (extended release, Glucophage® and Glucophage XR®) in Mexico.",
