      "question": "Why does the company focus on offering second brands of bisoprolol in countries such as Brazil and South Africa, and how does this strategy address social and economic disparities within the ESG framework?",
      "answer": "The rationale for offering second brands of bisoprolol in these countries is to provide affordable options for low-income patients, addressing healthcare accessibility in regions with significant economic disparities.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
