      "question": "Why is the disclosure of financial benefits to employee representatives on the Supervisory Board significant for demonstrating transparency and accountability in corporate governance under ESG frameworks?",
      "answer": "The context illustrates this integration by explicitly reporting the financial benefits granted to employee representatives, demonstrating transparency and accountability in governance practices.",
