      "question": "Why can Vonovia's payment of a tax-exempt special bonus to employees during the pandemic be considered a demonstration of its commitment to ESG principles, particularly social equity and employee welfare?",
      "answer": "The payment of a special bonus aligns with ESG principles by addressing social responsibility, supporting employees financially, and fostering a positive workplace culture during a challenging period.",
