      "question": "Why is the integration of individual reflection and collegial exchange in the 'Inhouse Leadership Exchange' program important for advancing SGL Carbon's corporate governance and leadership sustainability?",
      "answer": "Combining individual reflection and collegial exchange in the program helps participants gain personal insights while benefiting from peer perspectives, fostering a collaborative approach to leadership and corporate culture development.",
