      "question": "Why is freenet's focus on service and network quality essential for maintaining customer satisfaction and supporting its ESG goal of fostering reliable and equitable access to telecommunications services?",
      "answer": "Freenet's focus on service and network quality enhances customer satisfaction and experience, which are critical for maintaining and growing its subscriber customer base. This focus ensures reliable and high-quality telecommunications services.",
