      "question": "Why were personnel adjustments in Region Europe East more evident in the year-end headcount than in the average full-time equivalents, and how does this reflect wienerberger's workforce planning strategy?",
      "answer": "The personnel adjustments in Region Europe East, which began in the second quarter of 2023, were gradual and impacted the year-end headcount more significantly than the annual average full-time equivalents due to the timing of these changes.",
