      "question": "Why is low volatility important for ensuring the actual return on plan assets exceeds the return on corporate bonds in the medium to long term, and how does this align with sustainable financial planning?",
      "answer": "In the medium to long term, the actual return on plan assets is expected to exceed the return on corporate bonds with a good rating, particularly if volatility remains low.",
