      "question": "Why are data collection methods like surveys and interviews critical for shaping an evidence-based diversity strategy, and how do they align with ESG principles of transparency and stakeholder engagement?",
      "answer": "Data collection methods such as employee surveys and interviews with the Management and Supervisory Boards provide insights and inform the Groupwide diversity strategy process. These methods ensure that the strategy is evidence-based and reflective of stakeholder perspectives.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004188:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0011",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
