      "question": "Why are Executive Board members and dormant employees excluded from the headcount reported as of 31 December, and how does this practice reflect governance or social considerations in workforce reporting?",
      "answer": "The headcount reported as of 31 December excludes members of the Executive Board and dormant employees.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
