      "question": "Why is investing in employee retention and development, including training and continuing education, critical for achieving ESG goals related to human capital sustainability and organizational resilience?",
      "answer": "Employee retention and development, through training and continuing education, are significant as they contribute to workforce stability, skill enhancement, and long-term organizational growth, aligning with ESG principles of sustainability and human capital investment.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
