      "question": "Why has MTU faced challenges in achieving equitable progress across all units in increasing the proportion of women in management positions, and how do these challenges reflect broader ESG considerations?",
      "answer": "MTU has realized some potential effectively but not equally across all units, indicating uneven progress in increasing the proportion of women in management positions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004818:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0008",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
