      "question": "How does Evonik's whistleblower system demonstrate compliance with German and EU whistleblower protection regulations, and why is this alignment essential for ESG governance and regulatory accountability?",
      "answer": "Evonik's whistleblower system complies with German whistleblower protection legislation (HinSchG), which implements EU directive 2019/1937. This alignment ensures that reports can address issues and legal positions defined in these regulations.",
