      "question": "Why is long-term international professional experience critical for Supervisory and Executive Board members in achieving ESG objectives, such as effective governance and global sustainability leadership?",
      "answer": "Long-term international professional experience is emphasized to ensure that board members can effectively support and guide the company's international activities. This experience helps align the boards' composition with the global nature of the company's operations.",
