      "question": "Why is comparing GHG emissions intensity to production output essential for assessing ESG performance, and what does the 2023 reduction of 13.3% suggest about the organization's environmental efficiency?",
      "answer": "Comparing GHG emissions intensity to production output is important to evaluate environmental efficiency relative to economic activity. The 2023 data, showing a 13.3% reduction, suggests that the organization has made significant strides in decoupling emissions growth from production increases.",
