      "question": "Why is the discounted job bike leasing program significant for the company’s environmental sustainability efforts, and what does its adoption rate reveal about employee engagement with green initiatives?",
      "answer": "The discounted job bike leasing program aims to provide employees with an environmentally friendly and cost-effective commuting option. It is already being utilized by around 10% of the company's employees in Germany, reflecting its growing adoption.",
