      "question": "Why is it essential for the Supervisory Board of Deutsche Börse AG to collectively possess competencies in areas like sustainability, risk management, and regulatory compliance to advance ESG objectives?",
      "answer": "The Supervisory Board as a whole must collectively possess expertise in areas such as capital markets, stock exchange business models, clearing and settlement, IT and digitalization, strategy, sustainability, accounting, risk management, compliance, and regulatory requirements to effectively govern Deutsche Börse AG.",
