      "question": "How does the adjustment of Executive Board remuneration reflect the principles of consistency and fairness outlined in the 2021 remuneration system, and why is this important for governance transparency?",
      "answer": "The adjustment of Executive Board remuneration is conducted in line with the 2021 remuneration system, ensuring consistency with established guidelines and practices.",
