      "question": "Why does the double materiality analysis under the CSRD exclude 'Sustainable product innovations' as a material ESG aspect, and what implications does this have for SGL Carbon's sustainability strategy?",
      "answer": "Based on the double materiality analysis conducted in the 2023 fiscal year, 'Sustainable product innovations' was determined not to be a material ESG aspect according to the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD).",
