      "question": "Why did Vonovia face challenges in adapting technical training to an online format in 2020, and how does this highlight the importance of practical skill development in ESG-aligned workforce strategies?",
      "answer": "Vonovia faced challenges in offering technical training in 2020 due to the difficulty of converting practical, hands-on courses, such as those in plumbing and heating technology, to an online format. As a result, only a limited range of training could be provided during that year.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002457:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
