      "question": "Why is the differentiation between water catchment areas and production significant for Siltronic's ESG-focused water risk assessment, and how does it enhance the effectiveness of mitigation strategies?",
      "answer": "Differentiating between water catchment areas and production allows Siltronic to assess water risks more accurately by considering the specific environmental and operational contexts of each site. This helps in tailoring risk mitigation strategies effectively.",
