      "question": "Why does Lenzing's involvement in the Science Based Targets for Nature (SBTN) Corporate Engagement Group signify a strategic alignment with global ESG priorities, particularly biodiversity preservation?",
      "answer": "Lenzing's involvement in the SBTN Corporate Engagement Group reflects its proactive approach to integrating science-based targets into its ESG strategy. This commitment emphasizes its focus on preserving biodiversity and aligning corporate actions with global environmental goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003775:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
