      "question": "Why is the relationship between the allocation price and fair value significant in the context of the PSP tranche 2023, and how might this reflect ESG principles such as transparency and accountability?",
      "answer": "The allocation price serves as a baseline for determining the number of phantom performance shares awarded, while the fair value as of 31 December 2023 reflects the adjusted monetary worth of these shares based on performance and market factors.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
