      "question": "Why does the UNIQA Group's dual focus on CO₂ reduction and Paris-aligned investments in Austrian managers' variable remuneration reflect a balanced approach to operational and investment sustainability?",
      "answer": "The ESG-related provisions for Austrian managers' variable remuneration focus on CO₂ reduction in operational management and increasing the proportion of Paris-aligned issuers in the investment portfolio. This dual focus ensures attention to both operational and investment sustainability.",
