      "question": "Why does the organization evaluate technical feasibility, structural practicability, and economic viability when assessing energy-saving measures, and how does this align with sustainability principles?",
      "answer": "The feasibility of proposed measures is reviewed based on their technical feasibility, structural practicability, and economic viability to ensure they are effective and implementable.",
