      "question": "Why might uncertain framework conditions pose a risk to achieving consistent emissions reduction plans across INDUS Holding AG's portfolio companies, and how could ESG governance address this challenge?",
      "answer": "Using uncertain framework conditions as a reason for not setting emissions reduction plans could delay progress on sustainability goals and create inconsistencies in environmental accountability across portfolio companies.",
