      "question": "Why is it important for Wienerberger to include termination types (employee, employer, or mutual agreement) in its workforce turnover reporting, and how does this align with ESG transparency principles?",
      "answer": "The inclusion of various termination types indicates that Wienerberger aims to provide a comprehensive view of employee turnover. This level of detail ensures transparency and allows for a nuanced understanding of workforce changes.",
