      "question": "Why is it important for supervisory board members to avoid serving on the management board of another company where an IMMOFINANZ Executive Board member is involved, from an ESG governance perspective?",
      "answer": "This restriction prevents reciprocal relationships that could undermine the independence of the supervisory board member and create potential conflicts of interest between the two companies.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
