      "question": "Why is the European Commission prioritizing social standards in supply chains under the Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive, and what implications does this have for companies like AGRANA?",
      "answer": "The European Commission is focusing on ensuring the maintenance of minimum social standards within companies and their supply chains, aligning with initiatives like Germany's Supply Chain Due Diligence Act.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002565:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
