      "question": "Why might the company’s implementation of LinkedIn Learning for all employees worldwide support its ESG objectives, particularly in promoting equitable access to education and professional development?",
      "answer": "The company likely implemented LinkedIn Learning to provide accessible, diverse, and flexible learning opportunities for all employees. This platform supports professional growth across departments and enhances soft skills, aligning with the company’s commitment to global employee development.",
