      "question": "Why did Clearstream Banking S.A.'s conduct regarding Iran and other sanctioned countries lead to a grand jury investigation, and how does this relate to governance and compliance within ESG frameworks?",
      "answer": "The grand jury investigation was initiated due to Clearstream Banking S.A.'s conduct related to Iran and other countries subject to U.S. sanction laws.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
