      "question": "How does PORR contribute to biodiversity conservation through its construction practices?",
      "answer": "500 beehives, Bee@PORR initiative, Bienenlieb, FFH (Flora, Fauna, Habitat), amphibian migration paths, biodiversity-sensitive area, biological construction monitoring, floodplain grassland, homes for insects, migration barriers for toads, orchard meadows, rare species of bird, replacement spawning waters, swifts, toad tunnels, wetland habitats",
      "type": "Factoid",
