      "question": "What are some of the companies contributing to the Renewable Carbon Initiative's goal of transitioning to renewable carbon for organic chemicals and materials?",
      "answer": "BASF (Germany), Beiersdorf (Germany), Cosun Beet Company (The Netherlands), Givaudan (Switzerland), Henkel (Germany), IFF (USA), LanzaTech (USA), NESTE (Finland), UPM (Finland), Unilever (UK), Uniper (Germany)",
