      "question": "Which production steps are involved in creating concrete pavers, including surface treatments for durability?",
      "answer": "blasting, coating, concrete paver segment, concrete pavers, drying, grinding, mixing, shaping, surface treatment, washing",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001325:qa_pairs_factoid:0003",
