      "question": "Which practices in the circular economy are highlighted in the context as contributing to sustainability?",
      "answer": "circular economy, closure of material loops, extend their life cycle, novel recycling concepts, recyclability of our products, recycled sources, recycling silicon, reduce resource use, refurbished, repaired, reuse",
      "type": "Factoid",
