      "question": "What strategies has Frequentis AG adopted to enhance resource efficiency in its operations?",
      "answer": "LED, capture and presentation of consumption data, detailed breakdown of individual electricity consumers, efficient use of energy, free cooling, heat pumps, heating, cooling, and ventilation systems, modernisation of measuring and control technology, optimum use of exhaust heat, solar installations",
