      "question": "Which building design features are incorporated by CA Immo to support long-term adaptability and minimize environmental impact?",
      "answer": "building shell, ceiling loads, conversion and repurposing, depths, flexibility and reversibility of use, floor heights, future office landscapes, load-bearing structure, occupancy reserves, supply shafts",
      "type": "Factoid",
