      "question": "What criteria are used to evaluate the sustainability practices of suppliers for SMA Solar Technology AG?",
      "answer": "CO<sub>2</sub> footprint, corruption and bribery, diversity and equal opportunities, energy management, environmental protection, labor and human rights, living wages, occupational health and safety, quality, sustainable procurement",
      "type": "Factoid",
