      "question": "Which machine learning applications support sustainability goals in the Metals business area?",
      "answer": "forecast future measurement values, identify sensor drift, layer thickness measurement, layer thickness soft sensor, machine learning models, machine learning process parameters, predict sensor failures, real process data, soft sensors",
