      "question": "Which strategies are employed by IONOS to enhance energy efficiency and reduce environmental impact in its data centers?",
      "answer": "capacity utilization per server, energy-saving processors, enhanced energy efficiency, minimize heat losses, reduce electricity consumption, reduce the number of servers required, replacement of bare metal servers, virtual servers, virtualization",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
