      "question": "Which sustainability focus areas are prioritized by Vossloh for targeted action?",
      "answer": "Business ethics and human rights, Environmental and climate protection, Good corporate citizenship, Human resources and leadership, Occupational health and safety, Safe and sustainable mobility, Sustainability strategy and management, Sustainable supply chains and operations",
