      "question": "What key themes reflect the Zumtobel Group's commitment to sustainability in the lighting industry?",
      "answer": "best practices, broad network of experts, communications technology, data exchange, innovation, lighting industry organisations, standards, technological progress",
      "type": "Factoid",
