      "question": "Which upgrades contributed to improved energy efficiency across equipment and processes?",
      "answer": "new energy efficient equipment, new energy efficient line, one energy efficient tower, replacement of four old injection moulding machines, replacement of old pressure generators, replacement of two old air compressors, replacement of two old placement machines, two new energy efficient machines",
      "type": "Factoid",
