      "question": "Which sustainability-related reports and publications address forest management and biodiversity impacts?",
      "answer": "Austria reports from 2017 and 2020, Czech Republic and Slovakia forest reports, Forest Europe 2015, Indicators of sustainable forest management, Information on Forests and Forestry in the Czech Republic by 2017, Report on the Forest Sector of the Slovak Republic 2020, State of Europe's Forest 2015, Zpráva o stavu lesa a lesního hospodářství České republiky v roce 2020",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001046:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
