      "question": "What strategies are employed by Vossloh factories to optimize water usage in production processes?",
      "answer": "closed water circuits, coolant in various production processes, discharge standards of the public systems, local public water suppliers, production of concrete ties, public sewage systems, surface treatment of products, wastewater treatment plants",
      "type": "Factoid",
