      "question": "Which sustainable raw materials and products are identified as contributing to emissions reduction in the value chain?",
      "answer": "biomethanol, green C4 crack, green acetone, green ammonia, green hydrogen, green methanol, green naphtha, sustainable isophorone products",
      "type": "Factoid",
