      "question": "What sustainability-focused features are included in DOMCURA's building insurance module to promote eco-friendly recovery after damage?",
      "answer": "compensation of the emissions, consulting costs for sustainable technology, energy-efficient technology, incentivisation of sustainable materials, insurance services in the area of sustainability, purchase of certificates for climate protection projects, sustainability module, sustainable aspects or modules",
