      "question": "What innovative technologies and products are highlighted in Evonik's sustainability-driven initiatives?",
      "answer": "Next Generation Solutions, RNA technologies, SEPURAN® membranes, battery technology for e-mobility, fumed aluminum oxide for batteries, mRNA, nucleic acid-based medications, specialty lipids",
