      "question": "Which products developed by Evonik contribute to reducing environmental impacts?",
      "answer": "Excel® Rejuvenation process, POLYVEST® for tires with lower rolling resistance, TEGO® RC silicones, additives for hydraulic fluids, amino acids for animal nutrition, metal oxides for lithium-ion batteries, silica in paper production, silica-based rheology modifier",
      "type": "Factoid",
