      "question": "Which activities conducted by PORR have a significant impact on ecosystems and biodiversity?",
      "answer": "Building development, Land sealing, Lighting masts, Machinery and equipment, Night-time work, Noise pollution, Soil consumption, Vehicle traffic",
      "type": "Factoid",
