      "question": "What sustainability-focused processes are included in Bechtle Remarketing's IT hardware life-cycle management?",
      "answer": "purchase and sale of IT hardware, recycles or disposes of unusable parts, residual value for returned hardware, resold or leased, roll-out of new equipment, rollback of retired devices, secure erasure of the data, sustainable IT life-cycle management",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "validation:000290:qa_pairs_factoid:0006",
