      "question": "What are the key environmental objectives Hapag-Lloyd aims to achieve in its sustainability strategy?",
      "answer": "alternative fuels, alternative propulsion technologies, carbon-neutral maritime transport, decarbonisation, energy transition, reduce our carbon footprint, reduction of emissions",
