      "question": "Which sustainability topics were identified as material in WACKER's 2022 analysis?",
      "answer": "Competitiveness and value trends, Energy efficiency, Product safety, Resource consumption, Risk management, Safety of production plants, Sustainable products and innovations",
      "type": "Factoid",
