      "question": "What strategies and processes guide Commerzbank's approach to embedding sustainability in its business model?",
      "answer": "Commerzbank Group's strategy, annual strategy process, overarching sustainability area, strategic sustainability targets, sustainability measures, sustainability strategy, sustainable orientation of the business model",
