      "problem": "Which materials does AGRANA prioritize to ensure sustainable packaging for its products?",
      "solution": "Composite materials, FSC-certified paper, Virgin fibre, corrugated cardboard, paper packaging, recycled materials, virtually free of plastic",
      "attempt": "AGRANA, a global company that specializes in the processing of agricultural raw materials and the production of food ingredients, packaging materials, and sweets, places significant emphasis on sustainability across its operations, including packaging. To ensure sustainable packaging for its products, AGRANA prioritizes several key materials and practices:\n\n1. **Recycled Materials**: AGRANA increasingly uses recycled materials in its packaging to reduce waste and lower the environmental impact. This includes recycled plastics and paper.\n\n2. **Biodegradable and Compostable Materials**: The company is exploring and implementing biodegradable and compostable materials for certain product lines, which can break down naturally without leaving harmful residues.\n\n3. **Lightweight Packaging**: By using lighter materials, AGRANA reduces the amount of material used per unit of product, which in turn decreases the carbon footprint associated with transportation and disposal.\n\n4. **Sustainable Sourcing**: Ensuring that the raw materials used in packaging come from sustainably managed sources is another priority. This includes sourcing wood pulp for paper products from certified forests.\n\n5. **Innovative Packaging Solutions**: AGRANA invests in research and development to find new, more sustainable packaging solutions. This can include innovations in material science as well as design improvements that enhance recyclability or reduce material usage.\n\n6. **Reducing Plastic Use**: As part of broader industry trends towards reducing plastic pollution, AGRANA is working to minimize the use of single-use plastics and promote alternatives that are less harmful to the environment.\n\n7. **Consumer Education**: Alongside material choices, AGRANA also focuses on educating consumers about proper recycling and disposal methods to maximize the effectiveness of sustainable packaging efforts.\n\nBy focusing on these areas, AGRANA aims to align its packaging strategies with broader sustainability goals, contributing to a more environmentally friendly approach throughout its supply chain."
