      "question": "What initiatives are planned to modernize energy systems and reduce environmental impact?",
      "answer": "building shells, efficient system controls, efficient use of energy sources, energy-related modernisation, heating systems, non-fossil fuels, ongoing modernisation",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001385:qa_pairs_factoid:0010",
