      "question": "Which gases contribute to the greenhouse effect and are measured for their environmental impact?",
      "answer": "carbon dioxide (CO<sub>2</sub>), hydrofluorocarbons (HFCs), methane (CH4), nitrogen trifluoride (NF<sub>3</sub>), nitrous oxide (N2O), perfluorocarbons (PFCs), sulphur hexafluoride (SF<sub>e</sub>)",
