      "question": "What factors are prioritized in Westwing's sustainability guidelines for material and product selection?",
      "answer": "environmental footprint, hazardous materials, illegal logging, responsible cotton production, strict environmental and social criteria, sustainable forestry practices, toxic chemicals",
      "type": "Factoid",
