      "question": "Which sources and methodologies are referenced for calculating emissions in the BayWa Group's sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "Agribalyse, DBEIS (AR4 and 5), Exiobase 3.8.2, GEMIS (AR4), VDA (AR5), World Food LCA Database, ecoinvent",
