      "answer": "Business Partner Code, EU Taxonomy Regulation, German Act on Corporate Due Diligence Obligations in Supply Chains, German Whistleblower Protection Act, Lieferkettensorgfaltspflichtengesetz, Rules of procedure, V Policy statement",
