      "question": "Which channels does Bechtle use to communicate sustainability-related updates to stakeholders?",
      "answer": "Annual Report, Bechtle intranet, Bechtle website, customer magazine Bechtle update, e-mail, press releases, social media",
      "type": "Factoid",
