      "question": "Which sustainability-focused measures are being implemented in WACKER's logistics chains?",
      "answer": "logistics chains, logistics processes, optimizing shipments, overseas shipping of containers, railway networks, reduce the number of shipments, supply of raw materials",
      "type": "Factoid",
