      "question": "Which certifications ensure compliance with sustainability-related management systems in the ANDRITZ GROUP?",
      "answer": "ISO 14001, ISO 45001, ISO 9001, ISO certifications, environmental management systems, occupational health and safety management systems",
      "type": "Factoid",
