      "question": "What strategies does LD Celulose use to enhance biodiversity and forest connectivity in its managed areas?",
      "answer": "Legal Reserves, Permanent Preservation Areas, ecological corridors, fragments of native forest, habitat connectivity, riparian forests",
      "type": "Factoid",
