      "question": "How is ANDRITZ advancing resource-efficient production methods for electrical steel strip?",
      "answer": "NGO production, electrical steel strip, fully modular design, new furnace concept, rapid installation, simple operation and maintenance",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
