        "paragraph": "The WELL Health-Safety Rating of the international WELL Building Institute (IWBI) is based on the concept of measuring the characteristics of buildings in terms of their effect on human health. The following seven factors are applied:\n- Air\n- Air\n- Water\n- $\\bullet$  Food\n- Light\n- Fitness\n- $\\bullet$  Comfort\n- Understanding",
