      "question": "What key factors influenced global economic activity in 2023, including those tied to sustainability challenges like energy pricing and demographic shifts?",
      "answer": "European exports, declining demographic trend, economic activity, energy prices, high inflation, stable employment",
      "type": "Factoid",
