      "question": "What are some examples of eco-friendly innovations that utilize renewable resources?",
      "answer": "bio-based products, biosurfactants derived entirely from renewable raw materials, fully biodegradable, returned to the biological cycle, rhamnolipids, sugar-based biological products",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001631:qa_pairs_factoid:0005",
