      "question": "What are some partnerships and initiatives Evonik participates in to advance circular economy practices?",
      "answer": "Circular Economy for Flexible Packaging, Circular Valley initiative, European Chemical Industry Council Cefic, European Circular Plastics Alliance, Plastics Europe, WBCSD",
