      "question": "What initiatives does the company undertake to sustain expertise in radiation protection amidst the nuclear energy phase-out?",
      "answer": "active committees, knowledge about radiation protection topics, phasing out of nuclear energy, preservation of professional competence, radiation physics, young skilled physicists",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:002078:qa_pairs_factoid:0018",
