      "question": "Which responsibilities does the Corporate Sustainability & Innovation Department oversee to ensure compliance with sustainability goals and reporting standards?",
      "answer": "legal requirements regarding sustainability reporting, sustainability and innovation strategy, sustainability management, sustainability program, voluntary reporting on relevant topics, wienerberger's sustainability reporting",
      "type": "Factoid",
