          "Four quality promises pertain to categories 1 and 2, which were published in 2020. A year later, these were followed by a further five promises in categories 2, 3, 4 and 5. The publication of our latest promise in the \"Reliable Transport\" category is to be further advanced as part of Strategy 2023. The focus here is on \"punctual delivery\" and full transparency of the delivery status at container level so that we can make our services in ports, inland terminals and at our customers' locations transparent in their entirety. The integration of our digital dashboard  $\\mathbb{Z}^7$ , which was created in the previous year, ensures greater visibility. Our quality promises continue to be a central aspect of our strategy.",
