e lighting solutions and how they can contribute to reducing their carbon footprint.\n\n9. **Leadership and Change Management**: Fostering leadership skills specifically related to driving change towards more sustainable business practices.\n\nFor the most accurate and detailed information regarding the specific trainee program areas for 2023/24 at Zumtobel Group, it would be best to refer directly to the company's official communications or contact their HR department."
