      "question": "Which financial strategies enable Bechtle to maintain a competitive advantage in sustainability-focused long-term projects?",
      "answer": "continued positive development of the operating cash flow, excellent liquidity situation, free liquidity of €465.8 million, internal cash flow optimisation measures, positive cash flows in 2024 and beyond",
