      "question": "Who are the key contributors in the textile production chain collaborating with Lenzing to promote sustainable practices?",
      "answer": "Converters, Dye workers, Mills, Spinners, Weavers",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "test:000272:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
