      "question": "What sustainability benefits are achieved through the CO<sub>2</sub>OL Tropical Mix project in Panama?",
      "answer": "certified tropical timber, cocoa and seeds, longterm and fair employment, natural habitat for 15 endangered species, reforestation with improvements to the economic and social situation",
