      "question": "Which activities are examples of Scope 3 emissions according to MTU's sustainability strategy?",
      "answer": "downstream use of products, emissions relating to capital expenditure, evaluate MTU's Scope 3 emissions, upstream and downstream activities, upstream value creation by suppliers",
      "type": "Factoid",
