      "question": "Why is the collaboration between organizations like CDP, the United Nations Global Compact, the World Resources Institute, and the World Wide Fund for Nature essential for advancing science-based sustainability practices through the SBTi?",
      "answer": "The SBTi is a partnership involving CDP, the United Nations Global Compact, the World Resources Institute, and the World Wide Fund for Nature, collectively working to define best practices for science-based target setting.",
