      "question": "Why does the German Federal Network Agency’s decision to extend the system relevance of Scholven B and C until 2031 pose challenges to Uniper’s sustainability objectives, and what strategies might Uniper employ to address these conflicts?",
      "answer": "The decision to extend the system relevance of Scholven B and C until 2031 challenges Uniper’s coal phase-out timeline, requiring the company to find solutions that balance system needs with its sustainability goals of transitioning to carbon-free generation.",
