      "question": "Why did the geographical remoteness of western Afghanistan exacerbate the challenges of providing aid after the October 2023 earthquakes, and what does this reveal about the need for sustainable logistics in humanitarian efforts?",
      "answer": "Aid to Afghanistan after the October 2023 earthquakes was challenging due to the geographical remoteness of the affected western region, which complicated rescue and relief efforts. This logistical difficulty hindered the timely delivery of humanitarian assistance.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
