      "question": "Why do expanded sustainability regulations, such as the Packaging and Packaging Waste Directive (PPWD), require Zalando to prioritize data transparency, and what are the implications for their supply chain sustainability efforts?",
      "answer": "Expanded sustainability regulations, including the PPWD, require Zalando to enhance data transparency and secure reliable data from both internal operations and suppliers. These measures significantly influence decision-making and overall business operations.",
