      "question": "Why are purchased goods and services, energy-related emissions, and transport considered the most significant categories of scope 3 emissions for Wienerberger, and how does targeting these areas advance its sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "The three most significant categories of scope 3 emissions for Wienerberger are emissions from purchased goods and services, energy-related emissions, and transport from production sites to customers. These are being targeted by sourcing from low-emission suppliers, improving plant efficiency, and using low-emission vehicles for transport.",
