      "question": "Why are Evonik's investments in sustainable projects, such as battery technology, gas separation membranes, and specialty lipids, critical for advancing industrial transformation and addressing global sustainability challenges?",
      "answer": "Evonik is investing in projects such as a production facility for fumed aluminum oxide in Japan to support battery technology, expanding gas separation membranes in Austria, and building a specialty lipids facility in the USA for pharmaceuticals, all aimed at driving industrial transformation and mitigating climate change.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
