      "question": "Why might freenet choose to integrate development efforts into IT, strategy, and product development projects rather than establishing a dedicated R&D department, and how does this approach align with sustainability principles?",
      "answer": "Freenet might choose not to establish a dedicated R&D department because it effectively integrates development efforts into IT, strategy, and product development projects. This approach allows the company to remain agile and focused on specific innovations relevant to its competitive position.",
