      "question": "Why are ISO certifications (ISO 9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015, and ISO 45001:2018) essential for the Lenzing Group's sustainability strategy, and how do they ensure a structured approach to environmental and social responsibility?",
      "answer": "The ISO certifications (ISO 9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015, and ISO 45001:2018) demonstrate the Lenzing Group's commitment to quality management, environmental responsibility, and occupational health and safety, reinforcing its structured and systematic approach to sustainability.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001100:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
