      "answer": "The decrease in photovoltaic electricity generation at the Reutlingen headquarters, from 12.5 MWh to 9.6 MWh, may indicate variability in renewable energy output, possibly due to operational or environmental factors, though the company continues to fully utilize this energy by feeding it into the grid.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
