      "question": "Why is it important for Wienerberger to report success factors, challenges, and lessons learned in reducing Scope 3 emissions, and how does this practice contribute to sustainability transparency and continuous improvement?",
      "answer": "Wienerberger emphasizes reporting on success factors, challenges, and lessons learned to evaluate the effectiveness of their measures, identify areas for improvement, and share insights for continuous progress in reducing Scope 3 emissions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:002258:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
