      "question": "How does management review under ISO 9001:2015 ensure continuous improvement in sustainability strategies and quality management systems, and why is this process vital for achieving organizational and environmental goals?",
      "answer": "Management review under ISO 9001:2015 ensures that sustainability strategies and quality management systems are regularly evaluated and improved to meet organizational and environmental goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "test:000183:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
