      "question": "Why is the site checklist an essential tool in Volkswagen Group's sustainability strategy, and how do the reviewed criteria, such as biodiversity and circular economy measures, align with environmental stewardship goals?",
      "answer": "The site checklist is used to continuously review the implementation status of 143 environmental criteria. These include projects and measures related to biodiversity maintenance, environmentally friendly employee mobility, and circular economy promotion.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000432:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
