      "question": "Why is collaborating with suppliers and third-party brands on science-based targets essential for the company’s Climate Transition Plan, and how does this collective effort contribute to global emissions reduction goals?",
      "answer": "The broader goal is to extend the company’s climate initiatives beyond its operations by encouraging suppliers and third-party brands to adopt science-based targets, fostering a collective effort to reduce emissions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
