      "question": "Why is it essential for banks to align their strategies with sustainability frameworks like the SDGs and Paris Climate Agreement to ensure long-term resilience and contribute to global environmental and social progress?",
      "answer": "It is important for banks to align with sustainability frameworks to contribute to global and regional efforts to address environmental and social challenges, enhance their reputation, and ensure long-term business viability.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000036:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0014",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
