      "question": "Why does Evonik view the regulation of substances of concern (SoC) under the ESPR as a critical step toward achieving sustainability objectives in the chemical industry, particularly within a circular economy framework?",
      "answer": "Evonik supports this regulation because it is seen as an important step toward ensuring product safety within a circular economy framework.",
