      "question": "Why is LD Celulose's shift to rail wagons and break bulk vessels for pulp transportation a critical step in reducing greenhouse gas emissions, and what does this signify for sustainable logistics in the fiber industry?",
      "answer": "LD Celulose efficiently transported 500,000 tons of pulp using rail wagons and break bulk vessels instead of traditional truck and container ship modes, significantly reducing greenhouse gas emissions associated with transportation.",
