      "question": "Why were specific actions, such as avoiding refrigerant refills and insourcing warehouses, effective in reducing Scope 1 and 2 emissions, and how do these efforts contribute to the company’s sustainability performance?",
      "answer": "The reduction in Scope 1 and 2 emissions was achieved through energy efficiency projects, avoiding the refilling of air conditioning refrigerants, and consolidating operations by insourcing certain warehouses. These efforts collectively reduced the company's direct and indirect emissions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000875:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
