      "question": "Why might kaiserkraft have encountered challenges in standardizing the 'enkelfähig' rating across diverse international markets, and how do these challenges reflect broader sustainability implementation complexities?",
      "answer": "Kaiserkraft might have faced challenges such as standardizing the 'enkelfähig' rating across diverse markets, ensuring consistent application to over 100,000 products, and adapting the system to meet varying customer expectations and regulatory requirements in different countries.",
