      "question": "What strategies might the INDUS Group employ to ensure 100% of its companies follow the emissions reduction target path, and why is this level of participation essential for achieving their sustainability objectives?",
      "answer": "The INDUS Group aims for 100% of its companies to follow its emissions reduction target path. This reflects their commitment to ensuring all subsidiaries contribute to their sustainability goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
