      "question": "Why is the generation of green electricity from company-owned facilities, such as solar panels, a key component of Wienerberger's strategy to achieve net-zero indirect CO₂ emissions and enhance energy independence?",
      "answer": "The generation of green electricity from company-owned facilities, such as solar panels, enables Wienerberger to directly produce renewable energy, reducing reliance on non-renewable sources and contributing to its goal of achieving net-zero indirect CO₂ emissions.",
