      "question": "Why is Hapag-Lloyd's role as an Executive Committee member of the International Vessel Operator Dangerous Goods Association (IVODGA) critical for promoting sustainable practices in the transport of dangerous goods?",
      "answer": "Hapag-Lloyd serves as an Executive Committee member of IVODGA, indicating its active involvement in shaping policies and practices related to the safe transport of dangerous goods.",
