      "question": "Why are the operational milestones and measures implemented in 2022 for sales offices in Austria foundational for the Group's long-term sustainability strategy and alignment with international climate commitments?",
      "answer": "The operational milestones and measures implemented in 2022 for sales offices in Austria mark the Group's initial steps toward aligning with the Paris climate targets. These actions lay the foundation for long-term sustainability and emissions reduction.",
