      "question": "Why is it important for brand partners to provide specific data, such as the percentage of sustainability-related materials and supply chain certification points, for disclosing detailed sustainability attributes?",
      "answer": "The required information includes the percentage of sustainability-related materials used in a product and the point within the supply chain at which the final certification becomes valid.",
