      "question": "Why is the application of industrial rapid printing technology by the Technical University of Darmstadt significant for sustainable cultured meat production, and how does it address resource efficiency challenges?",
      "answer": "The Technical University of Darmstadt collaborates on applying industrial rapid printing technology to create complex meat structures, which is essential for producing cultured meat with intricate textures and forms.",
