      "question": "Why might a unified sustainability report fail to adequately address the Group's diverse product range, and how does segment-specific reporting support transparency and accountability in sustainability practices?",
      "answer": "A unified sustainability report might be less effective because it would not account for the diverse safety, quality, and sustainability requirements of the Group's extensive product range. Segment-specific reporting ensures that these unique aspects are adequately addressed.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
