      "question": "Why is the use of sustainable aviation fuels (SAFs) for engine testing a key element of MTU's sustainability strategy, and how does it contribute to reducing carbon emissions and advancing green energy solutions?",
      "answer": "The use of sustainable aviation fuels (SAFs) for engine tests on test stations helps MTU reduce its carbon footprint and reliance on traditional fossil fuels. This aligns with its goal of achieving carbon neutrality and promoting green energy solutions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001330:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
