      "question": "Why are the three pillars of the SMA energy concept—avoiding energy consumption, using energy more efficiently, and increasing the share of renewable energies—critical for achieving sustainable energy management?",
      "answer": "The three pillars of the SMA energy concept are avoiding energy consumption, using energy more efficiently, and increasing the share of renewable energies. These pillars collectively aim to enhance energy-related performance by reducing unnecessary energy use, optimizing energy efficiency, and transitioning to sustainable energy sources.",
