      "question": "Why does the Hapag-Lloyd sustainability report use GRI Standard 3 to address the impacts of its operations on the environment, society, and governance, and how does this framework guide their management approach?",
      "answer": "GRI Standard 3 covers the presentation of concepts for NfR-relevant aspects, including descriptions of their effects on the environment, people, and society, as well as the corresponding management approach with targets and measures.",
