      "question": "Why is the TRATON sustainability statement under the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) critical for aligning the Group's sustainability strategy with regulatory and capital market expectations?",
      "answer": "The TRATON sustainability statement, prepared under the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD), is significant as it provides transparency on the Group's sustainability efforts. It is being developed by the ESG function, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and alignment with capital market expectations.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000898:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
