      "question": "Why is the authorization to trade RSPO-certified palm oil products significant for Cefetra Limited, Cefetra B.V., and Cefetra Feed Services B.V., and how does it reflect their commitment to sustainable sourcing?",
      "answer": "Since 2021, Cefetra Limited, Cefetra B.V., and Cefetra Feed Services B.V. have been authorized to trade RSPO-certified palm oil products using the mass balance supply chain model, demonstrating their commitment to sustainable palm oil sourcing.",
