      "question": "Why is decarbonization a central focus of the regular meetings between Hapag-Lloyd's Executive Board and the Sustainability department, and how does this align with the company’s broader sustainability strategy?",
      "answer": "Regular meetings between the Executive Board and the Sustainability department primarily focus on sustainability topics, with a particular emphasis on decarbonization efforts.",
