      "question": "Why is the focus on livable neighborhoods in the Society and Contribution to Urban Development action area vital for social sustainability, and how does this approach enhance community resilience and well-being?",
      "answer": "The Society and Contribution to Urban Development action area focuses on creating livable neighborhoods where coexistence is worthwhile and enjoyable, enhancing community living and promoting social sustainability.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
