      "question": "Why is the Apparel Impact Institute (AII) critical to driving sustainability transformations in the apparel and footwear industry, and how does its role in the 'Roadmap to Zero' initiative support this mission?",
      "answer": "The Apparel Impact Institute (AII) plays a key role by identifying, funding, scaling, and measuring proven environmental impact solutions for the apparel and footwear industry. It collaborated on the 'Roadmap to Zero' to promote actionable strategies for achieving sustainability goals.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000562:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
