      "question": "Why is the Gold Standard certification significant for the wind power project supported by Manz, and how does it ensure alignment with sustainability principles and impactful greenhouse gas emission reductions?",
      "answer": "The Gold Standard certification signifies that the wind power project supported by Manz meets high environmental and social impact criteria, ensuring the project effectively offsets GHG emissions and contributes to sustainable development.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001920:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
