      "question": "Why are the company’s renewable energy initiatives, such as joining the Energize industry network and utilizing renewable energy certificates, critical for achieving a sustainable and decarbonized supply chain?",
      "answer": "The company’s renewable energy initiatives, such as joining the Energize industry network and using renewable energy certificates, aim to decarbonize not only its operations but also its supply chain. This demonstrates a holistic approach to sustainability and climate action.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "validation:000006:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0013",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
