      "answer": "The company provides annual compliance training to ensure that responsible behavior becomes a permanent part of employees' thinking and actions. This training supports the company's commitment to sustainability and ethical decision-making.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001185:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
