      "answer": "Setting goals and KPIs is significant for the Group as it provides measurable benchmarks to track progress and ensure accountability in achieving sustainability objectives, aligning efforts with broader ethical and social responsibility commitments.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
