        "paragraph": "The application of Circular Design Rules in new product development was intensified during the past year. CDR analyses were carried out and integrated in the product information portfolios for a number of existing products like the Zumtobel TRAMAO and VIVO luminaires.\nThe Circular Design Rules support the development of an information and functional basis for circular attributes and pave the way for a future digital product passport.",
