      "question": "Why does integrating Circular Design Rules into product portfolios represent a transformative step for sustainable product development, and how does this align with innovations like digital product passports?",
      "answer": "The integration implies a shift towards more sustainable product development practices, where circular attributes are prioritized and documented, enabling advancements such as digital product passports and improved lifecycle transparency.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000590:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
