      "question": "Why is increasing the share of higher-margin services and recurring revenue in the IT System House & Managed Services segment critical for sustainable growth, and how does this strategy impact the EBT margin?",
      "answer": "The company aims to increase the share of higher-margin services and recurring revenue in the IT System House & Managed Services segment. This growth is intended to be accompanied by a sustainable increase in the EBT margin.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001175:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
