      "question": "Why is it important for TAG to adopt a holistic approach to sustainability impacts across the life cycle of its real estate, and how does this approach contribute to energy efficiency and resource management?",
      "answer": "TAG takes a holistic view of sustainability impacts to improve energy efficiency and sustainable resource management throughout the life cycle of its real estate, from planning and construction to operation and maintenance.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:002357:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
