      "question": "Why is the inclusion of political representatives in the sustainability report crucial for aligning United Internet's practices with evolving sustainability regulations and contributing to policy innovation?",
      "answer": "Including political representatives suggests that United Internet acknowledges the importance of aligning its sustainability practices with regulatory frameworks and contributing to policy discussions on sustainability.",
