      "question": "Why is the avoidance and reduction of CO₂ emissions the core focus of Bechtle's Climate Protection Strategy 2030, and how does this contribute to global sustainability goals like the Paris Climate Agreement?",
      "answer": "The core focus of Bechtle's Climate Protection Strategy 2030 is the avoidance and reduction of CO₂ emissions. This strategy aligns with broader environmental goals by contributing to the objectives of the Paris Climate Protection Agreement, emphasizing sustainable practices within the company's operations and value chain.",
