      "question": "How does Evonik's Next Generation Culture initiative integrate sustainability into its organizational adaptability, and why is this integration critical for responding to global transitions in the workplace?",
      "answer": "The Next Generation Culture initiative enhances organizational adaptability by fostering employee involvement in shaping corporate culture, promoting sustainability practices, and aligning with core values. These efforts enable Evonik to respond more effectively to changes and challenges in the evolving world of work.",
