      "answer": "The transition from oil and gas to environmentally compatible energy sources is important for SBO as it reduces greenhouse gas emissions from operations, aligning with the company’s sustainability goals and contributing to a lower environmental impact.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
