      "question": "Why does the acquisition of properties with older heating systems pose challenges to achieving complete elimination of heating oil systems, and how does this impact the company’s sustainability objectives?",
      "answer": "A complete reduction of heating oil systems is unlikely in the near future due to the acquisition of properties with older heating systems that still rely on heating oil, making it challenging to fully eliminate their use.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "test:000227:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
      "difficulty_f1": 1.0,
