      "question": "Why is the 79% revenue contribution by suppliers with positive S-ratings significant for Volkswagen's sustainability objectives, and what does it reveal about the effectiveness of its procurement strategy?",
      "answer": "The 79% revenue contribution by suppliers with positive S-ratings highlights Volkswagen's success in aligning its procurement volume with suppliers who meet its sustainability standards. This demonstrates the effectiveness of the S-rating system in promoting responsible business practices.",
