      "question": "Why is the development of robust charging infrastructure a critical enabler for TRATON GROUP's goal of achieving 50% zero-emission vehicle sales by 2030, and what sustainability challenges does it address?",
      "answer": "TRATON GROUP's target of zero-emission vehicles comprising half of its annual sales by 2030 is closely tied to the development of charging infrastructure. Adequate infrastructure is essential to support the adoption and usability of all-electric vehicles.",
