      "question": "Why is it significant to provide additional details on the development of absolute CO<sub>2</sub> emissions, and how does this support transparency and informed decision-making in sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "Further details on the development of absolute CO<sub>2</sub> emissions (Scope 1 and Scope 2) are stated to be contained in subsequent sections, suggesting a more in-depth analysis is available elsewhere in the report.",
