      "question": "Why are Volkswagen's measures to reduce the carbon footprint of electric vehicles essential for its transformation into a provider of sustainable mobility solutions and alignment with global climate goals?",
      "answer": "The broader goal of Volkswagen's measures, such as renewable electricity use and CO<sub>2</sub>-reduced materials, is to support its transformation into a provider of sustainable mobility solutions and align with global climate commitments.",
