      "question": "Why does the inclusion of heating costs in Swedish rental systems present challenges for cross-country comparisons, and how might this influence sustainability metrics like energy consumption transparency?",
      "answer": "The inclusion of heating costs in Swedish rental systems impacts comparability because it alters the structure of rental pricing, making direct comparisons with countries like Germany and Austria less straightforward.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "validation:000122:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
