      "question": "Why is transforming the aviation sector through initiatives like SESAR critical for achieving the European Green Deal's climate neutrality goals, and what role does efficiency play in this transformation?",
      "answer": "The transformation of the aviation sector is essential because achieving climate neutrality by 2050 requires fundamental changes to reduce emissions and improve efficiency. SESAR's initiatives, such as optimizing flight routes and automating processes, are key to this transformation.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
