      "question": "What sustainability verification processes does Lenzing implement to ensure dissolving wood pulp suppliers meet certification standards, and why are these processes critical for environmental compliance?",
      "answer": "Lenzing verifies the sustainability of dissolving wood pulp suppliers by ensuring that all wood input is either FSC® or PEFC certified or controlled. This involves due diligence processes and compliance with certification standards, supported by annual audits.",
