      "question": "Why is it important to set sustainability targets specifically for 'Downstream transportation and distribution,' and how might this contribute to reducing the environmental footprint of the supply chain?",
      "answer": "Categorizing sustainability targets under 'Downstream transportation and distribution' highlights a focus on reducing environmental impacts or improving efficiency in the later stages of the supply chain.",
