      "question": "Why does the reliance on landlords' service charge invoices and staggered billing periods pose challenges for accurately measuring heating consumption, and how does this impact sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "The context highlights challenges such as inconsistent and staggered meter reading and billing periods, as well as the reliance on landlords' service charge invoices to determine heating consumption in many locations. These factors make it difficult or even impossible to capture exact data for heating consumption.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000189:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0001",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
