      "question": "Why was the partnership with local environmental organizations in Peru and Ecuador critical to the success of Coastal Cleanup Day, and how did the educational component enhance sustainability awareness?",
      "answer": "Employees in Peru and Ecuador partnered with local environmental organizations, attended a presentation on ocean ecological challenges, and cleaned a local beach, collecting 433 kilograms of refuse. Their efforts highlighted both education and impactful action.",
