      "question": "How does the Corporate Sustainability & Innovation Department ensure compliance with legal sustainability requirements, and why is this critical for Wienerberger's transparency and regulatory adherence?",
      "answer": "The department oversees the fulfillment of all legal requirements related to sustainability reporting, ensuring that Wienerberger adheres to regulatory standards and maintains transparency in its sustainability practices.",
