      "question": "Why is achieving a minimum standard of BREEAM Excellent, DGNB Gold, or LEED Gold essential for Warimpex's alignment with best practices in sustainability and its commitment to high-quality developments?",
      "answer": "Achieving these minimum standards ensures that Warimpex's developments align with best practices in sustainability. It reflects the company's dedication to environmental responsibility and its goal of maintaining high-quality, energy-efficient properties.",
