        "paragraph": "The SYZYGY GROUP has taken action to cut CO<sub>2</sub> emissions and reduce its environmental footprint (CCF). In 2023, total  $CO<sub>2</sub>$  emissions were reduced by 25 per cent to 753.43 tonnes of  $CO<sub>2</sub>$  (previous year: 1,003 tonnes of  $CO<sub>2</sub>$ ). On a per employee basis, emissions stood at 1.23 tonnes of CO<sub>2</sub> (previous year: 1.74 tonnes of  $CO<sub>2</sub>$ ), representing a 29 per cent reduction compared to the previous year.",
