      "question": "Why is it important for the SYZYGY GROUP to report both total and per-employee CO<sub>2</sub> emissions, and how does this dual focus enhance transparency and accountability in sustainability reporting?",
      "answer": "Focusing on both total and per-employee emissions allows the SYZYGY GROUP to demonstrate overall environmental impact reduction while highlighting individual-level efficiency and accountability in sustainability efforts.",
