      "question": "Why is it important to combine insights from the R&D dashboard with commercial portfolio evaluations, and how does this integration support the organization's sustainability and circular economy goals?",
      "answer": "Combining insights from the R&D dashboard with commercial portfolio evaluations allows the organization to align its R&D activities with broader commercial goals. This integration helps steer future R&D efforts toward creating more sustainable products and solutions.",
