      "question": "Why is it important for the company to classify both positive and negative impacts of its business activities in its Sustainability Report, and how does this support its corporate responsibility goals?",
      "answer": "Classifying the impacts of business activities allows the company to transparently and comprehensively inform stakeholders about both the positive and negative effects of its operations, aligning with its commitment to corporate responsibility.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001334:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
