      "question": "Why is the replacement of cushioning foams with recycled materials, such as shredded cardboard, a significant step toward reducing dependency on virgin resources and enhancing packaging sustainability?",
      "answer": "Replacing cushioning foams with recycled materials reduces reliance on non-recyclable resources, supports waste reduction, and aligns with the company’s sustainability goals for packaging.",
