      "question": "Why are compensatory or remedial measures essential for mitigating the environmental impacts of business activities, and how do they support biodiversity conservation within sustainability frameworks?",
      "answer": "Compensatory or remedial measures are implemented when necessary to mitigate the impact of business activities, ensuring that conservation objectives of protected areas are not significantly affected.",
