      "question": "Why is the factory’s initial production capacity of 1 gigawatt significant for scaling sustainable energy solutions, and how does its planned expansion to 3 gigawatts enhance its environmental impact?",
      "answer": "The initial capacity of 1 gigawatt demonstrates the factory’s ability to produce large-scale electrolyzers for green hydrogen production. This capacity is scheduled to increase to 3 gigawatts by 2025, further scaling up sustainable hydrogen output.",
