      "question": "How does Zalando's Facility Improvement Program (FIP) contribute to supply chain decarbonization, and why is collaboration with Tier 1 and Tier 2 partners essential for achieving sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "The FIP is significant as it involves collaboration with Tier 1 and Tier 2 supply chain partners to develop action plans for reducing greenhouse gas emissions. It emphasizes energy efficiency and renewable energy use, contributing to supply chain decarbonization.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001486:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
