      "question": "Why is balancing the ecological functions of forests with their economic utility critical for ensuring the long-term availability of wood as a sustainable raw material under the Forest Europe process?",
      "answer": "The long-term availability of wood as a raw material is emphasized to balance the ecological functions of forests with their economic utility. This ensures forests can continue to provide resources sustainably while maintaining their ecosystems.",
