      "question": "Why does Zalando focus exclusively on packaging it procures directly for emissions considerations, and how does this approach align with its sustainability governance and operational control strategy?",
      "answer": "Zalando focuses only on packaging it procures directly as an online retailer, excluding third-party-procured packaging, to concentrate on areas where it has direct control and can implement sustainability measures.",
