      "question": "Why does CA Immo’s centralized approach to water and waste management, including smart meters and professional waste agreements, exemplify best practices in sustainability and operational efficiency?",
      "answer": "CA Immo’s centralized management of water and waste, combined with initiatives like smart water meters and professional waste management agreements, demonstrates a commitment to resource efficiency, cost optimization, and environmental responsibility, aligning with sustainability principles.",
