      "question": "Why is separating packaging waste by type essential for the Zumtobel Group's sustainability goals, and what benefits does this practice offer in terms of resource efficiency and environmental impact?",
      "answer": "Separating packaging waste by type allows the Zumtobel Group to recycle it efficiently through disposal firms, reducing environmental impact and supporting sustainability efforts.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
