      "question": "Why is the EU expected to remain a net importer of sugar in SMY 2023/24 despite increased production, and how does this align with sustainability goals for self-sufficiency and resource optimization?",
      "answer": "Even with increased production and rising exports and stocks, the EU is expected to remain a net importer of sugar due to continued domestic demand exceeding production levels.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001088:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
