      "question": "Why are Lenzing's energy mix improvements, such as the adoption of biomass and renewable electricity, essential for reducing its reliance on fossil fuels and achieving long-term sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "Lenzing's efforts to improve its energy mix, such as acquiring a biomass power plant and using renewable electricity, directly reduce its reliance on fossil fuels. These actions are part of a broader strategy to transition to sustainable energy sources and decrease the environmental impact of its operations.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
