      "question": "Why is it critical for the report to specify compliance with the EPRA Sustainability Best Practices Recommendations Guidelines, and how does this enhance its alignment with sustainability principles?",
      "answer": "It is important for the report to explicitly state its compliance with a specific version of the EPRA Guidelines to ensure clarity and precision about the standards followed, which helps maintain consistency and allows stakeholders to evaluate the report against the correct framework.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
