      "question": "Why is promoting varroa resistance breeding through hive care and collaboration with the Upper Austria-Salzburg beekeeping group important for ecological sustainability and biodiversity conservation?",
      "answer": "Varroa resistance breeding is being promoted through ongoing care of hives and collaboration with the Upper Austria-Salzburg beekeeping group.",
