      "question": "Why is the addition of the Skoda brand to Volkswagen Financial Services AG's portfolio in Germany significant for advancing sustainable mobility and diversifying eco-friendly transportation options?",
      "answer": "Adding the Skoda brand to the portfolio in Germany highlights Volkswagen Financial Services AG's efforts to diversify its offerings and cater to a broader customer base, enhancing its mobility services and subscription product range.",
