      "question": "How does 'Sustainability at Hapag-Lloyd' encapsulate the integration of environmental, social, and governance principles into its operations, and why is this central to its long-term value creation?",
      "answer": "'Sustainability at Hapag-Lloyd' is central as it encapsulates the company’s overarching commitment to integrating environmental, social, and governance principles into its operations, ensuring long-term value creation.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001660:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
