      "question": "Why are unfavourable growing conditions a sustainability concern in the context of the potato processing campaign, and how might this highlight the need for climate-resilient agricultural practices?",
      "answer": "Sustainability could be a concern due to the reliance on favourable growing conditions for consistent yields, highlighting vulnerabilities in agricultural production systems when faced with adverse environmental factors.",
