      "question": "Why did Viscom's Supervisory Board decide to integrate sustainability criteria into the remuneration system, and how does this decision align with stakeholder expectations and sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "In 2021, Viscom's Supervisory Board expanded the remuneration system to include sustainability criteria, such as employee turnover and energy consumption, alongside financial indicators. This decision aimed to place greater emphasis on sustainability, reflecting the growing focus on this area among stakeholders.",
