      "question": "Why is collaboration among employees, stakeholders, and leadership essential for achieving sustainable transformation within the KION Group, and how does this approach reflect its corporate values?",
      "answer": "Collaboration is emphasized because achieving sustainable transformation requires the collective effort of employees, stakeholders, and leadership. This shared responsibility ensures that sustainability is integrated across all levels of the organization.",
