      "question": "Why is Deutsche Börse Group's submission of annual communications on progress (COPs) critical for ensuring transparency and accountability in its sustainability efforts under the UN Global Compact?",
      "answer": "Deutsche Börse Group ensures accountability in implementing the UN Global Compact principles by submitting annual communications on progress (COPs) since 2009, detailing how it incorporates the Compact's ten principles into its operations.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000813:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0009",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
