        "paragraph": "Lenzing has been invited to present at an event of the WWF Climate Group Talks<sup>27</sup> on \"How to integrate biodiversity in your core business.\" Additionally, Lenzing contributed to a study by WWF and Ernst & Young \"Management in the biodiversity crisis - How Austrian companies minimize risks and seize opportunities\" <sup>28</sup> (translated title, study is in German language) with general insights and a case study.\n<sup>&</sup>lt;sup>23</sup> Geburek, T., Büchsenmeister, R., Englisch, M., Frank, G., Hauk, E., Konrad, H., Liebmann, S., Neumann, M., Starlinger, F. and Steiner, H. (2015). Biodiversitätsindex Wald",
