      "question": "Why is the motto 'towards transparent, traceable, sustainable supply chains together' central to the Cefetra Group's sustainability activities, and how does it reflect their collaborative approach?",
      "answer": "The Cefetra Group's sustainability motto is 'towards transparent, traceable, sustainable supply chains together.' This signifies a collaborative approach to creating accountable and environmentally responsible supply chains in its operations.",
