      "question": "Why does the reduction in specific energy consumption, despite lower factory utilization, demonstrate the importance of technological advancements in achieving sustainability in the Starch segment?",
      "answer": "The reduction in specific energy consumption, even with lower factory utilization, indicates that efficiency improvements are not solely dependent on production levels but are driven by technological and process advancements.",
