      "question": "Why is prioritizing low-carbon aluminium production critical for the Ranshofen facility's compliance with sustainability standards and its competitive positioning in the eco-friendly metals market?",
      "answer": "Focusing on low-carbon aluminium is critical for the Ranshofen facility as it ensures compliance with environmental standards, secures future demand for eco-friendly materials, and strengthens the facility's position in the sustainable metal market.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:002286:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
