      "question": "Why is it important to include consumption values for disincorporated companies like SELZER and SCHÄFER in sustainability metrics, and how does this practice ensure transparency and accountability?",
      "answer": "Including consumption values for disincorporated companies like SELZER and SCHÄFER up to mid-year ensures that sustainability metrics accurately reflect their contributions before disincorporation, maintaining data integrity.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
