      "answer": "Using totes for packaging is sustainable because they are made of recyclable high-density polyethylene and are part of a system where they can be returned, reused, or recycled, minimizing environmental impact.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
