      "question": "Why is evaluating both CO2 compensation and energy consumption critical for understanding the product's compliance with sustainability benchmarks and its contribution to environmental stewardship?",
      "answer": "Considering both CO2 compensation and energy consumption provides a holistic view of sustainability, addressing both emissions and resource efficiency, which together contribute to the product's overall environmental performance and score.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:000848:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0010",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
