      "question": "Why is reducing the environmental impact of its businesses a key priority for the company’s sustainability strategy, and what benefits does this focus bring to long-term environmental stewardship?",
      "answer": "The company focuses on reducing the environmental impact of its businesses to align with sustainability goals and mitigate the negative effects that hazardous chemical products could have on the environment.",
