      "question": "Why does MLP SE consider its commitment to the UN Global Compact initiative essential for fostering sustainable corporate governance and driving continuous improvement in sustainability practices?",
      "answer": "MLP SE considers its commitment significant because it aligns with its goal of reinforcing sustainable and responsible corporate governance, while also providing opportunities for continuous development and optimization of its sustainability practices.",
